WEBVTT

00:48.960 --> 00:49.960
Come on, Bro.

00:53.085 --> 00:56.001
Whoo! Whoo, whoo, whoo!

01:05.126 --> 01:06.751
Whoo!

01:10.835 --> 01:12.125
Whoo!

01:12.126 --> 01:13.959
Whoa. Whoa.

01:13.960 --> 01:15.042
Hey, watch it.

01:15.043 --> 01:16.875
You were in my way, Bro.

01:16.876 --> 01:18.376
Oh, okay.

01:19.043 --> 01:21.168
Whoo--

01:24.418 --> 01:25.626
Whoo!

01:29.626 --> 01:30.835
Whoo!

01:32.501 --> 01:34.084
Whoo!

01:34.085 --> 01:35.542
Is that
all you got?

01:35.543 --> 01:37.668
You want to go faster, huh?

01:45.626 --> 01:47.710
Whoo-hoo!

01:54.168 --> 01:55.501
That was cool, Bro.

01:56.168 --> 01:57.751
Skxawng, let go.

02:01.043 --> 02:02.375
It was cool riding
with you, Bro.

02:02.376 --> 02:03.668
High four.

02:12.001 --> 02:13.668
All right,
I got to get back, Bro.

02:14.501 --> 02:15.751
Little Brother,

02:16.376 --> 02:18.376
tell me one thing
before you go.

02:21.001 --> 02:22.210
How did I die?

02:28.876 --> 02:30.335
You got shot.

02:31.876 --> 02:34.043
We could have escaped, but I
made us go back for Spider.

02:35.251 --> 02:36.585
Then we had to go back.

02:37.376 --> 02:38.459
That's not your fault.

02:38.460 --> 02:39.626
Tell that to Dad.

02:40.210 --> 02:42.293
We weren't even supposed
to be out there.

02:43.710 --> 02:46.625
I got us caught
because I disobeyed orders.

02:46.626 --> 02:48.418
That's just you, Little Bro.

02:58.835 --> 03:00.210
I love you, Brother.

03:00.835 --> 03:01.835
Skxawng.

03:07.751 --> 03:09.335
I killed my brother.

03:10.210 --> 03:11.418
No matter what happens,

03:12.168 --> 03:15.543
I have to live with that
for the rest of my life.

03:54.043 --> 03:55.126
I wish I could do it.

03:55.668 --> 03:57.710
No, I wish I could do it.

03:59.460 --> 04:02.084
If I have another
stupid seizure underwater...

04:02.085 --> 04:03.167
Yeah,

04:03.168 --> 04:05.000
you'd be me
without a mask.

04:07.335 --> 04:08.750
- Uh, let's test that.
- Hey, hey.

04:08.751 --> 04:10.292
- Watch it.
- See what happens.

04:10.293 --> 04:11.418
Hey, watch the stitches.

04:12.543 --> 04:14.417
Uh-huh. Yeah,
how do you like that, huh?

04:14.418 --> 04:15.418
No! Ow!

04:38.293 --> 04:39.959
The fire of hate

04:39.960 --> 04:41.835
leaves only
the ash of grief.

04:43.793 --> 04:45.209
My mother mourned

04:45.210 --> 04:46.293
the ancient way,

04:46.835 --> 04:49.376
singing her son's life
during the daily eclipse.

04:51.293 --> 04:53.168
Because the light
always returns.

05:02.710 --> 05:03.835
There's the Na'vi way,

05:04.835 --> 05:06.335
and then there's
my dad's way.

05:07.043 --> 05:09.418
Say nothing.
Keep busy.

05:28.251 --> 05:30.501
The Reef People say
the sea washes you clean.

05:32.001 --> 05:33.584
Washes away your sins.

06:10.543 --> 06:11.543
What do you got?

06:13.376 --> 06:14.792
You're supposed
to be collecting guns.

06:14.793 --> 06:16.251
That thing's useless.

06:16.835 --> 06:17.960
Focus, boy.

06:23.710 --> 06:25.335
Don't let your mother
see that.

06:34.376 --> 06:35.375
Hey, excuse me.

06:35.376 --> 06:36.917
- Sorry.
- Excuse me.

06:36.918 --> 06:38.043
- Tuk.
- Sorry.

06:45.126 --> 06:46.126
Bro.

06:47.751 --> 06:49.001
Ah, sick.

06:50.418 --> 06:51.418
What is this?

06:52.668 --> 06:53.668
Tsireya?

06:55.168 --> 06:56.501
What are you doing?

06:58.876 --> 07:01.417
This is an AR, all right?

07:01.418 --> 07:03.542
This is the mag.
It's where the bullets are.

07:03.543 --> 07:04.710
Empty.

07:05.626 --> 07:06.626
Slap it.

07:07.585 --> 07:08.625
Rack it.

07:08.626 --> 07:10.000
And then, boom,

07:10.001 --> 07:11.125
you can just spray.

07:11.126 --> 07:13.375
You can kill
a lot of Sky People with this.

07:13.376 --> 07:15.542
See? Ceramic action.

07:15.543 --> 07:17.667
You clean 'em and oil 'em,
be as good as new.

07:17.668 --> 07:19.750
This is not the Na'vi way,

07:19.751 --> 07:20.959
Jakesully.

07:20.960 --> 07:23.125
Weapons of metal
are forbidden.

07:23.126 --> 07:24.209
You know this.

07:24.210 --> 07:25.292
To touch them

07:25.293 --> 07:26.710
poisons the heart.

07:27.210 --> 07:28.292
Eywa

07:28.293 --> 07:29.376
will provide.

07:30.001 --> 07:31.876
Right.

07:32.918 --> 07:35.292
The mourning period
is not even over.

07:35.293 --> 07:36.209
Tuk.

07:36.210 --> 07:37.667
You should be
with your family,

07:37.668 --> 07:39.459
not gathering these things.

07:39.460 --> 07:41.042
Your woman

07:41.043 --> 07:42.168
needs you.

07:44.210 --> 07:47.210
My son lies with the ancestors
in the reef.

07:48.085 --> 07:49.709
This is our home.

07:49.710 --> 07:51.667
I said I would stand and fight,

07:51.668 --> 07:54.459
but I can't fight gunships
with spears.

07:54.460 --> 07:56.375
We sank the demon ship.

07:56.376 --> 07:58.126
The pink skins fear us now.

07:59.751 --> 08:01.792
Yeah? We got lucky.

08:01.793 --> 08:03.251
And they got many more ships.

08:04.043 --> 08:05.460
Least we got these.

08:06.668 --> 08:09.001
We are grateful you
stand with us, Jakesully.

08:09.668 --> 08:11.084
It is not guns we need.

08:11.085 --> 08:12.501
It is Rider of Last Shadow.

08:14.293 --> 08:16.000
Ride great toruk

08:16.001 --> 08:18.043
as you did before.

08:18.710 --> 08:22.709
When you ride the beast,

08:22.710 --> 08:24.043
you become the beast.

08:25.335 --> 08:27.418
And the more blood,
the better.

08:29.085 --> 08:31.042
I will not become

08:31.043 --> 08:33.001
Toruk Makto again.

08:34.043 --> 08:35.251
Jakesully,

08:36.210 --> 08:38.335
you are always Toruk Makto.

08:39.501 --> 08:41.543
Come. Rotxo.

08:47.210 --> 08:48.251
Can you hear me?

08:48.876 --> 08:50.167
Yeah, we can
hear you loud and clear.

08:50.168 --> 08:51.168
Go on, Doc.

08:52.085 --> 08:55.417
So, uh, we've been through
the wreck, inside and out.

08:55.418 --> 08:58.585
Uh, we've searched to about
a 200-meter radius around it.

08:59.126 --> 09:00.709
We didn't find
any Na'vi bodies.

09:00.710 --> 09:03.792
Just crew or...
what's left of 'em.

09:03.793 --> 09:06.167
Well, keep looking, Doctor.

09:06.168 --> 09:08.459
- Expand the search radius.
- Roger that.

09:08.460 --> 09:09.375
Of note though,

09:09.376 --> 09:11.376
I did find an interesting
new algae.

09:13.168 --> 09:14.667
Hello? Can you hear me?

09:14.668 --> 09:16.959
- Sully is still out there.
- We don't know that.

09:16.960 --> 09:19.125
Scavengers could have
carried off the bodies.

09:19.126 --> 09:21.667
Nope. He made it out.

09:21.668 --> 09:25.167
And he's in this area.
Down to a handful of villages.

09:25.168 --> 09:26.709
You just give me a ship
and I'll--

09:26.710 --> 09:27.875
I gave you a ship.

09:27.876 --> 09:29.626
It's right there,
on the bottom.

09:30.376 --> 09:31.793
Yeah. Along with my crew.

09:32.626 --> 09:33.626
All dead.

09:34.626 --> 09:36.459
You brought me out here,

09:36.460 --> 09:38.584
twenty-six trillion miles,

09:38.585 --> 09:40.292
for a single mission,

09:40.293 --> 09:41.875
a kinetic hard kill op

09:41.876 --> 09:43.876
against one guy.

09:44.418 --> 09:46.335
I ain't backing off.

09:50.001 --> 09:52.085
Are we still connected? Hello?

09:53.210 --> 09:54.793
Do they have me on mute?

10:01.710 --> 10:04.085
The spirit of my ancestors
is in this bow.

10:06.543 --> 10:07.751
It was our strength.

10:10.918 --> 10:13.376
I can help you
fix it, Lo'ak.

10:15.085 --> 10:16.085
No!

10:17.335 --> 10:18.418
It's ruined!

10:19.626 --> 10:21.626
Everything I touch
gets ruined.

10:26.751 --> 10:28.251
They never talked about it.

10:30.293 --> 10:31.751
But it was there
in the room.

10:32.376 --> 10:34.334
Like a crouching thanator.

10:37.501 --> 10:39.626
I know you will never
give up your bow.

10:41.626 --> 10:42.626
So...

10:47.501 --> 10:49.251
Just don't be close
when it hits.

11:08.043 --> 11:10.210
So, you agree with Ronal?

11:14.001 --> 11:15.959
I will never speak against
my husband

11:15.960 --> 11:17.460
in front of that woman.

11:20.085 --> 11:21.293
Look, I'm a marine.

11:23.251 --> 11:25.126
I'm not taking a knife
to a gunfight.

11:27.335 --> 11:28.460
Or a prayer.

11:31.126 --> 11:32.835
So, what am I
supposed to do?

11:33.918 --> 11:36.376
I can't run.
I can't fight.

11:36.876 --> 11:37.876
Oh, that's right.

11:38.543 --> 11:41.625
Eywa will provide. Yeah?
So, where was Eywa?

11:41.626 --> 11:43.417
Where was Eywa
when our son--

11:43.418 --> 11:44.418
Jake!

11:47.085 --> 11:49.626
I'm in this place
where I have nothing.

11:50.835 --> 11:53.460
Not my people,
not my forest.

11:54.918 --> 11:56.835
Even my father's bow
is gone.

11:59.835 --> 12:00.960
All I have...

12:02.251 --> 12:03.501
is my faith

12:04.335 --> 12:06.751
that this is
the Great Mother's plan.

12:09.710 --> 12:11.293
You have this family.

12:25.501 --> 12:26.835
And you have me.

12:29.126 --> 12:31.085
And I love you so much.

12:54.585 --> 12:56.709
Yeah, Payakan,
you're the man!

13:23.960 --> 13:24.960
Whoa. Bro, Bro.

13:28.210 --> 13:30.710
This is sick!

13:32.960 --> 13:35.001
- Whoo! Whoo!
- Whoo-hoo!

13:37.001 --> 13:38.501
Whoo!

13:45.293 --> 13:47.043
- Whoo!
- Bro, come on! Go, go, go, go!

13:47.751 --> 13:49.543
- Oh, sh...
- Yeah!

13:54.668 --> 13:56.334
That was insane, cuz.

13:56.335 --> 13:57.501
I know, right, Bro?

13:59.668 --> 14:00.835
I thought you were dead.

14:04.751 --> 14:07.500
It sucks that Payakan
is still an outcast.

14:07.501 --> 14:09.375
Yeah. After saving
all our asses.

14:09.376 --> 14:11.084
No.
I'm sorry,

14:11.085 --> 14:13.167
but by the tulkun way,
he bears the deaths.

14:14.168 --> 14:15.585
All those
who died in the battle.

14:16.501 --> 14:17.876
He bears those deaths.

14:20.043 --> 14:22.835
I'm sorry. You saved us all.

14:29.501 --> 14:31.334
Forever, Brother.

14:31.335 --> 14:32.417
Always.

14:45.376 --> 14:46.376
Dad!

14:50.585 --> 14:52.334
- Wait, where's the spare?
- It's in the basket, I think.

14:52.335 --> 14:53.667
Hey! Wake up! Where is it?

14:53.668 --> 14:55.542
- Hey! Where's the spare mask?
- What?

14:55.543 --> 14:57.292
Where's the spare mask?
Used to be there. Where is it?

14:57.293 --> 14:58.709
- I don't know.
- Find it.

14:58.710 --> 15:00.542
- It's not here.
- Speak to me. Where is it?

15:00.543 --> 15:02.625
- I can't find it.
- Hey, hey! Where is it?

15:02.626 --> 15:04.043
- Come on. Come on. Come on.
- I got it. Dad.

15:04.585 --> 15:06.210
- Dad. I found it.
- Hurry.

15:11.418 --> 15:13.209
Spider, no.

15:13.210 --> 15:14.292
Breathe.

15:14.293 --> 15:16.292
- Breathe.
- Breathe.

15:16.293 --> 15:17.668
Deep and slow.

15:18.335 --> 15:19.501
Deep and slow.

15:20.001 --> 15:21.417
There you go.
You're okay.

15:21.418 --> 15:24.543
I'm good.
I'm good. I'm okay.

15:26.710 --> 15:28.835
Skxawng.
You have to be careful.

15:29.376 --> 15:31.000
- Careful's my middle name.
- Yeah, skxawng.

15:31.001 --> 15:32.542
You should be more careful,
little baby.

15:32.543 --> 15:33.625
Pay attention.

15:33.626 --> 15:36.417
- Get off. Get off. Get off.
- Stupid is your middle name.

15:36.418 --> 15:37.500
- Be careful, little baby.
- No, let him go.

15:37.501 --> 15:39.584
- You have to pay attention.
- Skxawng is his middle name.

15:39.585 --> 15:41.834
- Are you sure you're okay?
- Yeah, I feel fine.

15:44.001 --> 15:45.125
The Windtraders.

15:45.126 --> 15:46.918
The Windtraders are here.

15:48.543 --> 15:49.750
The Windtraders
are coming.

15:49.751 --> 15:50.834
Come on!

15:50.835 --> 15:51.960
Come on. Let's go.

15:52.460 --> 15:53.668
Come on.

15:54.626 --> 15:55.750
Come on, Tuk.

15:59.543 --> 16:01.168
Whoo!

16:18.085 --> 16:20.376
Hey!

16:35.710 --> 16:36.710
Tsireya.

16:40.376 --> 16:42.084
Look.

16:42.085 --> 16:43.709
Look at him.

16:43.710 --> 16:45.293
He's not going
to take up much room.

16:46.001 --> 16:47.501
As long as he's no trouble.

16:48.501 --> 16:50.375
- Take a knee. Let's go. Tuk.
- Kiri.

16:50.376 --> 16:51.834
- Come on, Kiri.
- What?

16:51.835 --> 16:53.709
- Kiri, please.
- Children, please sit down.

16:53.710 --> 16:54.751
Please, sit.

16:56.251 --> 16:59.001
Your mother and I have
come to a decision.

17:04.085 --> 17:06.084
Spider, you're going to live
back in High Camp with Norm.

17:06.085 --> 17:07.834
- What?
- The Windtraders will take you.

17:07.835 --> 17:09.875
- No, Dad.
- No, Dad. He can't.

17:09.876 --> 17:12.375
Spider, you can't live
in a mask

17:12.376 --> 17:13.459
day and night.

17:13.460 --> 17:15.375
I just want
to stay here with you.

17:15.376 --> 17:18.085
- I know, but it's too risky.
- This isn't fair.

17:18.918 --> 17:21.084
Please. You're the only family
I've ever known.

17:21.085 --> 17:22.584
This is what's
best for you.

17:22.585 --> 17:24.334
But, Dad,
he's our best friend.

17:24.335 --> 17:25.709
Can't we just
find a way?

17:25.710 --> 17:26.792
It's too dangerous.

17:26.793 --> 17:29.125
You're one dead battery away
from being dead yourself.

17:29.126 --> 17:31.292
He belongs
with his own kind.

17:31.293 --> 17:32.126
Mom.

17:32.751 --> 17:35.834
And what kind
is that, Mother? Alien?

17:35.835 --> 17:37.209
- Kiri.
- Pink-ass.

17:37.210 --> 17:38.292
- Kiri.
- Stop.

17:38.293 --> 17:40.751
You hate them so much,
that's all you see.

17:41.585 --> 17:42.585
It's Spider.

17:43.460 --> 17:44.750
Please, Jake.

17:44.751 --> 17:46.917
Mr. Sully, I won't be
any problem. You know that.

17:46.918 --> 17:48.125
Dad, this isn't right.

17:48.126 --> 17:50.334
Spider is part of this family.

17:50.335 --> 17:51.834
He will never

17:51.835 --> 17:53.793
- be a part of this family.
- Mother, no.

17:56.168 --> 17:59.000
The caravan is the safest way
to move him.

17:59.001 --> 18:00.542
- No, please.
- He's going today.

18:00.543 --> 18:02.584
- You can't do this. Dad, he's--
- It's a done deal.

18:02.585 --> 18:06.084
Enough! This is a family.
It's not a democracy.

18:06.085 --> 18:07.292
All right?

18:07.293 --> 18:08.375
I hate you!

18:08.376 --> 18:09.584
This is what is best,
baby girl.

18:09.585 --> 18:10.667
- No!
- Hey, it's okay.

18:10.668 --> 18:12.001
Don't touch me!

18:12.751 --> 18:14.293
Hey. It's okay.

18:15.710 --> 18:16.960
- You understand?
- No.

18:18.460 --> 18:20.043
I already lost my brother.

18:20.751 --> 18:22.251
I can't lose anyone else.

18:28.835 --> 18:30.584
Sullys stick together.

18:32.210 --> 18:34.418
Yep, that's
the family motto.

18:38.335 --> 18:40.000
- It's bullshit.
- This isn't fair.

18:40.001 --> 18:41.709
Okay, okay.

18:41.710 --> 18:43.542
Hey. All right.
How about this?

18:43.543 --> 18:45.709
We all go together
to drop him off.

18:45.710 --> 18:46.543
Kiri.

18:48.251 --> 18:50.250
You said you wanted to see
your grandmother.

18:50.251 --> 18:53.835
Yeah, it will be an adventure.
For the whole family.

18:58.418 --> 19:00.126
Yeah. Cool.

19:12.960 --> 19:14.126
Hey, stay here.

19:16.793 --> 19:20.334
Our arrangement was
for the pink-skinned boy only.

19:20.335 --> 19:21.959
We won't be any trouble.

19:21.960 --> 19:23.417
You are already trouble.

19:23.418 --> 19:25.500
A trader must move freely.

19:25.501 --> 19:26.501
We cannot choose sides.

19:27.335 --> 19:29.167
Having Toruk Makto
on board

19:29.168 --> 19:32.376
cuts very close to
choosing a side in this war.

19:33.001 --> 19:34.750
Yeah, but you're mistaken.

19:34.751 --> 19:36.835
Toruk Makto
was never on your ship.

19:39.626 --> 19:41.793
But if he was ever
aboard, then...

19:43.043 --> 19:45.792
him and his woman would be
happy to fly as outriders

19:45.793 --> 19:47.210
and protect your caravan.

19:50.251 --> 19:51.376
Perhaps so.

19:52.335 --> 19:54.626
The Mangkwan raiders
grow more aggressive.

19:55.126 --> 19:56.126
Hmm.

19:56.793 --> 19:58.668
Very well.
I meet you on this.

20:05.335 --> 20:06.710
Cast off!

20:08.001 --> 20:09.125
Come on.

20:09.126 --> 20:10.418
Cast off!

20:12.585 --> 20:14.251
Cast off below!

20:19.751 --> 20:21.875
Lo'ak! Lo'ak!

20:21.876 --> 20:23.418
Oh, Tsireya!
Tsireya!

20:23.918 --> 20:24.751
Lo'ak!

20:26.168 --> 20:27.501
Ready about!

20:28.918 --> 20:31.500
Ready about! On all lines.

20:31.501 --> 20:33.001
Bow to starboard.

20:40.543 --> 20:42.959
Windward vanes out full!

20:42.960 --> 20:45.250
Haul out and raise
full to windward!

20:45.251 --> 20:46.376
Heave!

20:46.960 --> 20:49.710
Heave!

20:52.501 --> 20:53.751
Heave!

20:56.001 --> 20:58.251
Lighten ship. Come up easy.

21:05.876 --> 21:07.418
Windward out full!

21:11.335 --> 21:13.835
Make all and set taut!

21:54.793 --> 21:56.210
Whoo! Yeah!

22:03.376 --> 22:05.251
Everyone mourns
in their own way.

22:09.251 --> 22:10.418
For me,

22:10.960 --> 22:12.251
it's being up here alone.

22:15.126 --> 22:16.876
I feel him with me.

22:19.376 --> 22:20.501
Bro, check it out.

22:21.126 --> 22:23.418
I hear his voice
in the wind.

22:39.585 --> 22:40.585
Hold this.

22:50.335 --> 22:52.334
- Hey, Dad, I've been thinking.
- Yeah?

22:52.335 --> 22:53.834
I should carry a rifle.

22:53.835 --> 22:55.250
And I could fly with you.

22:55.251 --> 22:56.251
Yeah.

22:57.085 --> 22:58.584
That's gonna happen.

22:58.585 --> 23:00.125
Why not?

23:00.126 --> 23:01.709
You trained me to shoot, okay?

23:01.710 --> 23:03.210
I know what I'm doing.

23:03.751 --> 23:05.292
Yeah? Where's your comms?

23:05.293 --> 23:06.710
I called you like five times.

23:08.376 --> 23:10.001
Wear your comms.

23:10.710 --> 23:11.710
That's rule number one.

23:13.668 --> 23:15.001
You can't even do that.

23:27.210 --> 23:28.335
Bring up the next one.

23:30.376 --> 23:31.376
That's it.

23:34.001 --> 23:35.167
What you got?

23:35.168 --> 23:36.709
So, I promised this guy
on imaging

