Let's go.

54:16.126 --> 54:16.960
Come on.

54:17.710 --> 54:18.626
Through here.

54:30.210 --> 54:31.335
Tsahìk.

54:33.626 --> 54:34.793
They are gone.

54:37.626 --> 54:39.292
We search by air.

54:48.251 --> 54:49.251
Tarsem.

54:50.460 --> 54:51.917
What? Oh.

54:51.918 --> 54:53.375
Easy, easy. Max!

54:53.376 --> 54:55.209
- Be still, child.
- Okay. No, no, no.

54:55.210 --> 54:57.042
No. Stop it. Stop her.

54:57.043 --> 54:58.417
- Daughter.
- My children.

54:58.418 --> 55:00.125
- Neytiri, be calm.
- My children!

55:00.126 --> 55:01.584
Daughter, calm.

55:01.585 --> 55:04.042
My children.
The children.

55:04.043 --> 55:05.375
Where?

55:06.835 --> 55:08.167
Where are they?

55:24.751 --> 55:26.750
Come on. Let's hustle.
Max, get me in.

55:26.751 --> 55:27.834
- Yeah, yeah.
- Are we hot?

55:27.835 --> 55:28.917
We're hot.

55:28.918 --> 55:30.168
All right. Don't even calibrate.

55:31.918 --> 55:34.292
No. You must rest, my child.

55:34.293 --> 55:35.375
Daughter.

55:35.376 --> 55:36.585
- Good luck.
- Thank you.

55:38.876 --> 55:40.209
I will ride.

55:40.210 --> 55:41.875
Come.
No. No.

55:44.126 --> 55:46.085
I'm okay.
I'm okay to walk.

55:53.418 --> 55:54.418
I've got you.

56:02.543 --> 56:03.625
This is good.

56:07.210 --> 56:08.251
Lie down.

56:14.543 --> 56:15.667
We're clear.

56:15.668 --> 56:16.668
Yeah.

56:17.710 --> 56:19.501
Which brings us to our...

56:20.251 --> 56:21.751
unresolved issues.

56:26.751 --> 56:28.126
Well, I'm out of arrows.

56:30.876 --> 56:32.751
Still got our knives.

56:38.335 --> 56:39.543
Yeah, well I'm kind of tired.

56:40.751 --> 56:43.460
Yeah.

56:44.626 --> 56:45.918
Yeah, better save it.

56:48.085 --> 56:49.085
In case those...

56:50.126 --> 56:51.750
flying monkeys
show up.

56:55.085 --> 56:56.126
Yeah, sure.

57:07.293 --> 57:08.709
You and the missus
must have done

57:08.710 --> 57:10.376
something right,
I'll give you that.

57:11.251 --> 57:12.625
He's a good kid.

57:14.168 --> 57:15.585
Yeah, he's a great kid.

57:18.168 --> 57:19.959
Hey, uh, this don't mean

57:19.960 --> 57:22.210
we're going to start
taking long walks together.

57:23.210 --> 57:24.834
I'm still bringing you in.

57:24.835 --> 57:27.085
Dead, if I have to.

57:29.418 --> 57:31.876
All this time out here
and you still don't get it.

57:34.251 --> 57:36.875
This world goes much deeper

57:36.876 --> 57:38.210
than you imagine.

57:40.085 --> 57:42.376
You witnessed it tonight.

57:43.793 --> 57:44.793
With her.

57:46.210 --> 57:47.710
And with him.

57:48.751 --> 57:49.960
Don't matter.

57:52.126 --> 57:54.876
It don't matter
what color I am.

57:56.835 --> 57:59.210
I still remember
what team I'm playing for.

58:01.668 --> 58:03.501
You got new eyes,
Colonel.

58:04.835 --> 58:06.418
All you got to do
is open them.

58:28.793 --> 58:30.000
It's them.

58:30.001 --> 58:31.000
It's the Ash.

58:31.001 --> 58:32.417
Get up. Come on.
We got to move. Let's go.

58:32.418 --> 58:34.375
- Come on. Come on.
- Come on.

58:34.376 --> 58:35.543
Come on. We got to move.

58:38.960 --> 58:40.084
It's okay. It's okay.

58:40.085 --> 58:41.584
They're ours.
They're ours.

58:42.626 --> 58:43.626
Tarsem!

58:47.876 --> 58:50.209
- Jake.
- Tarsem.

58:50.210 --> 58:53.167
Kiri, Tuk, are you hurt?

58:53.168 --> 58:54.376
How did you find us?

58:55.876 --> 58:57.460
Children!

58:59.543 --> 59:00.834
- Mother.
- Mama.

59:00.835 --> 59:02.793
Tuk. Tuk. Kiri.

59:03.418 --> 59:04.626
Lo'ak.

59:06.793 --> 59:08.376
- Hey.
- Jake.

59:09.210 --> 59:10.500
Are you okay?

59:10.501 --> 59:11.792
Come here. It's okay.

59:11.793 --> 59:12.751
We're okay.

59:14.876 --> 59:16.250
Hey, Norm.

59:18.501 --> 59:19.501
What's up?

59:22.751 --> 59:23.751
What?

59:25.376 --> 59:26.459
What...

59:26.460 --> 59:27.543
Dude.

59:28.585 --> 59:29.500
Oh.

59:29.501 --> 59:31.543
Yeah, I'm good
on the whole air thing.

59:40.418 --> 59:42.335
Tuktirey.

59:42.835 --> 59:44.168
Kiri.

59:50.251 --> 59:51.792
Iron Sky,
Blue One actual.

59:51.793 --> 59:52.875
We're inbound

59:52.876 --> 59:54.126
at the city wall.

01:00:05.501 --> 01:00:07.126
So, you think
he's still with Sully?

01:00:08.126 --> 01:00:09.500
I'd make book on it.

01:00:09.501 --> 01:00:11.542
This is not my priority.

01:00:11.543 --> 01:00:14.042
My priority is getting
this city built

01:00:14.043 --> 01:00:15.750
and sending back amrita
to pay for it.

01:00:15.751 --> 01:00:16.834
And who do you think

01:00:16.835 --> 01:00:18.085
sets your priorities,
General?

01:00:18.710 --> 01:00:19.917
It's the
big-picture guys.

01:00:19.918 --> 01:00:21.917
So here's a big-picture
concept for you.

01:00:21.918 --> 01:00:23.667
How are we supposed
to colonize this world

01:00:23.668 --> 01:00:25.043
if we can't breathe
the fricking air?

01:00:25.876 --> 01:00:27.334
You want to
find the boy,

01:00:27.335 --> 01:00:28.917
you got to
find Sully.

01:00:28.918 --> 01:00:30.834
- And I'm there.
- Ow. Ow.

01:00:30.835 --> 01:00:32.084
How many more
of these, huh?

01:00:32.085 --> 01:00:33.125
Not many more.

01:00:33.126 --> 01:00:34.250
That's what
you said yesterday.

01:00:34.251 --> 01:00:35.209
Don't be a baby.

01:00:35.210 --> 01:00:36.459
Here's the most
recent scan.

01:00:36.460 --> 01:00:37.625
Now, you see this?

01:00:37.626 --> 01:00:39.209
This is all mycelium.

01:00:39.210 --> 01:00:40.667
It's basically
the same thing

01:00:40.668 --> 01:00:41.750
as the forest network.

01:00:41.751 --> 01:00:42.834
Somehow,

01:00:42.835 --> 01:00:44.000
it colonized him,

01:00:44.001 --> 01:00:45.750
spread through
his entire system

01:00:45.751 --> 01:00:47.125
and then
made changes

01:00:47.126 --> 01:00:49.001
at the cellular level.
I mean, look.

01:00:49.751 --> 01:00:51.584
It altered
his blood chemistry,

01:00:51.585 --> 01:00:53.084
his nervous system,
his lungs.

01:00:53.085 --> 01:00:54.293
Can you get it out?

01:00:55.376 --> 01:00:57.042
No, it's an endosymbiont.

01:00:57.043 --> 01:00:59.085
We think they're keeping
each other alive.

01:00:59.751 --> 01:01:01.293
It could kill him
if we even try.

01:01:02.001 --> 01:01:03.917
But look.
I mean, he's...

01:01:03.918 --> 01:01:04.834
he's alive.

01:01:04.835 --> 01:01:06.709
He's healthy.

01:01:06.710 --> 01:01:07.918
Maybe this is
a good thing.

01:01:08.418 --> 01:01:09.418
A good thing?

01:01:13.335 --> 01:01:14.792
What if the RDA labs

01:01:14.793 --> 01:01:16.168
could reverse
engineer this?

01:01:16.710 --> 01:01:18.250
What if every human being on Earth

01:01:18.251 --> 01:01:20.292
could live here without a mask?

01:01:22.626 --> 01:01:25.875
Uh, Jake,
there's something else.

01:01:25.876 --> 01:01:27.917
Sit. Hey, bud.

01:01:27.918 --> 01:01:29.000
Hey.

01:01:29.001 --> 01:01:30.167
- Okay, let me see.
- Hey.

01:01:30.168 --> 01:01:32.376
Hold-Hold still. Hold still.
You're fine.

01:01:34.710 --> 01:01:36.042
Look at that.

01:01:36.043 --> 01:01:37.043
What are you doing?

01:01:37.710 --> 01:01:38.834
What is that?

01:01:38.835 --> 01:01:40.168
He's growin' a kuru.

01:01:41.251 --> 01:01:43.293
- Wait, what?
- Oh, yeah.

01:01:58.668 --> 01:01:59.835
Great Mother,

01:02:01.126 --> 01:02:02.168
are you there?

01:02:03.085 --> 01:02:04.126
Please.

01:02:04.710 --> 01:02:06.418
Hear my small voice.

01:02:08.793 --> 01:02:11.250
I prayed to you
in the forest

01:02:11.251 --> 01:02:12.793
to save
my friend.

01:02:13.710 --> 01:02:15.168
I prayed so hard.

01:02:18.210 --> 01:02:19.376
But you didn't come.

01:02:21.043 --> 01:02:22.542
You didn't answer.

01:02:22.543 --> 01:02:25.043
So I had
to do it myself.

01:02:26.085 --> 01:02:27.167
I don't know how I...

01:02:27.168 --> 01:02:28.209
I...

01:02:28.210 --> 01:02:30.085
I asked the roots
to help me.

01:02:31.126 --> 01:02:32.543
I don't remember
how I--

01:02:35.626 --> 01:02:37.042
Please, no.

01:02:37.043 --> 01:02:38.668
No, don't shut me out.

01:02:39.626 --> 01:02:40.918
Why am I like this?

01:02:42.335 --> 01:02:44.168
How am I doing
these things?

01:02:45.043 --> 01:02:46.960
Please, just talk to me.

01:02:47.501 --> 01:02:48.501
Please.

01:02:50.001 --> 01:02:51.668
No, no.
Please, please.

01:02:52.543 --> 01:02:54.334
No. No.

01:02:54.335 --> 01:02:56.543
No. No!

01:03:07.335 --> 01:03:09.168
- EEG is fine.
- It's blinking. So--

01:03:09.918 --> 01:03:11.167
That's blood pressure.
That's normal.

01:03:11.168 --> 01:03:12.542
You want that blinking.

01:03:12.543 --> 01:03:14.084
- Let's take these off.
- Kiri.

01:03:14.085 --> 01:03:16.875
- Run more tests.
- Eywa never came to me.

01:03:16.876 --> 01:03:18.625
I told you.

01:03:18.626 --> 01:03:20.584
I don't know
how I did it.

01:03:20.585 --> 01:03:21.668
Drink.

01:03:22.210 --> 01:03:23.210
Kiri.

01:03:24.085 --> 01:03:27.585
My child, you are touched
by the All Mother's hand.

01:03:28.710 --> 01:03:30.125
This we
have known

01:03:30.126 --> 01:03:31.376
since you
were born.

01:03:39.918 --> 01:03:41.793
There's something
you're hiding.

01:03:42.460 --> 01:03:44.000
I have felt it

01:03:44.001 --> 01:03:45.125
my whole life.

01:03:45.126 --> 01:03:47.459
Just tell me the truth.

01:03:47.460 --> 01:03:48.460
Please.

01:03:50.335 --> 01:03:51.335
Tell her.

01:03:54.126 --> 01:03:55.210
It is time.

01:03:58.001 --> 01:03:59.001
My child.

01:04:00.876 --> 01:04:01.876
You do not

01:04:03.085 --> 01:04:05.084
have a father, Kiri.

01:04:05.085 --> 01:04:06.085
What?

01:04:06.793 --> 01:04:07.792
You...

01:04:07.793 --> 01:04:09.125
Your... Your mother,

01:04:09.126 --> 01:04:10.376
Grace's avatar,

01:04:10.918 --> 01:04:12.500
now,
when she was pregnant,

01:04:12.501 --> 01:04:13.875
Norm ran some tests.

01:04:13.876 --> 01:04:15.292
And it was a path...
pathelo--

01:04:15.293 --> 01:04:17.085
A-A parthenogenic birth.

01:04:17.710 --> 01:04:20.334
You're genetically identical
to the avatar.

01:04:20.335 --> 01:04:22.376
There literally
is no father.

01:04:23.501 --> 01:04:25.251
I'm a clone?

01:04:26.710 --> 01:04:28.000
Granddaughter.

01:04:28.001 --> 01:04:30.168
It was the will
of Eywa.

01:04:32.460 --> 01:04:35.084
When the dreamwalker body
lay here

01:04:35.085 --> 01:04:37.460
in the Great Mother's
hands...

01:04:39.626 --> 01:04:42.001
...a seed was planted.

01:04:54.543 --> 01:04:56.085
That really
sucks.

01:04:56.960 --> 01:04:59.625
That makes me
even more of a freak.

01:04:59.626 --> 01:05:01.959
No, granddaughter.

01:05:01.960 --> 01:05:04.918
You are Eywa's child.

01:05:11.210 --> 01:05:12.292
I don't care

01:05:12.293 --> 01:05:13.293
how it happened.

01:05:14.335 --> 01:05:16.210
You're my baby girl.

01:05:17.085 --> 01:05:19.543
And I'm the only father
you'll ever need.

01:05:24.501 --> 01:05:25.710
If I am so special,

01:05:28.001 --> 01:05:30.335
why does Eywa
fold her ears to me?

01:05:33.376 --> 01:05:34.750
Look, we don't know why,

01:05:34.751 --> 01:05:36.500
but you're locked out
from her.

01:05:36.501 --> 01:05:37.917
It's some kind
of firewall.

01:05:37.918 --> 01:05:39.084
Yeah, it's like
an encryption.

01:05:39.085 --> 01:05:40.334
The harder
you try to break in,

01:05:40.335 --> 01:05:41.751
the harder
it fights back.

01:05:43.918 --> 01:05:45.375
Eywa has a path
for you.

01:05:45.376 --> 01:05:47.376
Though she chooses
to conceal it,

01:05:48.251 --> 01:05:50.292
you must trust in her.

01:05:50.293 --> 01:05:52.292
I have to find out
what it is.

01:05:52.293 --> 01:05:54.335
No, you have
to stop asking.

01:05:55.793 --> 01:05:57.500
Kiri, if...

01:05:57.501 --> 01:05:59.667
if you try
to connect again,

01:05:59.668 --> 01:06:00.668
you could die.

01:06:01.293 --> 01:06:03.626
You do it underwater,
and you will die.

01:06:08.626 --> 01:06:10.459
He can't stay here.

01:06:10.460 --> 01:06:11.876
If the RDA get him...

01:06:12.543 --> 01:06:14.085
well, we'll never
stop 'em.

01:06:15.335 --> 01:06:17.292
If he is so dangerous,

01:06:17.293 --> 01:06:19.085
to The People, to everything,

01:06:20.251 --> 01:06:21.835
we should just kill him.

01:06:25.585 --> 01:06:27.876
It's Spider.

01:06:28.876 --> 01:06:30.750
He'll come with us.
He'll come

01:06:30.751 --> 01:06:32.000
to the reef.

01:06:32.001 --> 01:06:33.460
We can protect him there.

01:06:35.293 --> 01:06:37.668
Toruk Makto knows best.

01:06:38.460 --> 01:06:40.000
Oh, come on, baby.

01:06:40.001 --> 01:06:41.126
It's not like that.

01:06:41.918 --> 01:06:43.043
It is decided.

01:06:55.001 --> 01:06:56.918
Thirty meters.
Get me up in there.

01:07:03.460 --> 01:07:05.125
Get me in the pocket.

01:07:05.126 --> 01:07:07.460
Get me in the pocket
with the rocket.

01:07:08.126 --> 01:07:09.126
Ten meters.

01:07:11.626 --> 01:07:13.418
Here we go. And...

01:07:29.460 --> 01:07:30.917
Lung shot.

01:07:30.918 --> 01:07:32.043
She's bleeding out.

01:07:35.085 --> 01:07:36.210
Whoo!

01:08:06.751 --> 01:08:09.417
A new demon ship
has come.

01:08:09.418 --> 01:08:11.250
Bigger.

01:08:11.251 --> 01:08:12.835
More of our tulkun
have been killed.

01:08:13.376 --> 01:08:14.626
I'm so sorry, Brother.

01:08:15.126 --> 01:08:16.209
Jakesully,

01:08:16.210 --> 01:08:19.167
the outcast is stirring up
the young bulls.

01:08:19.168 --> 01:08:20.959
Our tulkun
have called for council

01:08:20.960 --> 01:08:22.168
to decide about him.

01:08:24.376 --> 01:08:25.376
You must rest.

01:08:26.876 --> 01:08:29.001
This must be removed.
See me.

01:08:29.543 --> 01:08:30.960
Kids. Kids, on me.

01:08:42.251 --> 01:08:44.084
No, I'm serious.
When it grows long enough,

01:08:44.085 --> 01:08:45.584
I'm going to get
my own ilu.

01:08:45.585 --> 01:08:47.292
Skxawng.

01:08:47.293 --> 01:08:48.875
You need
a very small ilu.

01:08:48.876 --> 01:08:49.959
Just you watch,

01:08:49.960 --> 01:08:51.417
I'm going to
get my own skimwing.

01:08:51.418 --> 01:08:53.043
- Oh, a skimwing?
- Then I'll be the one laughing.

01:08:53.543 --> 01:08:55.085
So, how is this?

01:08:55.876 --> 01:08:56.959
Your daughter,

01:08:56.960 --> 01:08:59.001
your half-blood daughter,

01:09:00.585 --> 01:09:01.793
with no training...

01:09:03.001 --> 01:09:04.500
Hold here.

01:09:04.501 --> 01:09:07.126
...has done what
no Tsahìk could do?

01:09:08.460 --> 01:09:11.000
Who are you to question
the will of Eywa?

01:09:11.001 --> 01:09:12.292
I am Tsahìk!

01:09:12.293 --> 01:09:13.835
Then be Tsahìk!

01:09:14.460 --> 01:09:15.835
These herbs
do nothing!

01:09:16.835 --> 01:09:19.001
Herbs from my forest
heal faster.

01:09:20.251 --> 01:09:21.875
I tell you to rest.

01:09:21.876 --> 01:09:23.417
You do not rest.

01:09:23.418 --> 01:09:25.460
Then you blame
my herbs.

01:09:27.001 --> 01:09:28.001
Hold still.

01:09:30.793 --> 01:09:32.209
Stupid woman.

01:09:32.210 --> 01:09:33.750
Careful, Tsahìk,

01:09:33.751 --> 01:09:35.167
or I may forget

01:09:35.168 --> 01:09:36.667
that you are with child.

01:09:57.626 --> 01:09:59.500
The matriarch has spoken.

01:09:59.501 --> 01:10:02.084
She says the outcast
continues

01:10:02.085 --> 01:10:03.876
to defy the tulkun way.

01:10:04.710 --> 01:10:06.542
All killing is forbidden.

01:10:06.543 --> 01:10:08.250
He was outcast
for this,

01:10:08.251 --> 01:10:10.293
but he has
done it again.

01:10:11.043 --> 01:10:13.709
The outcast attacked
a demon ship,

01:10:13.710 --> 01:10:15.335
bringing death
to our people.

01:10:16.585 --> 01:10:17.667
Even the son

01:10:17.668 --> 01:10:18.835
of Toruk Makto.

01:10:20.960 --> 01:10:22.500
Dad, they can't blame
Payakan for that.

01:10:22.501 --> 01:10:23.584
Not now.

01:10:29.751 --> 01:10:32.085
She says he continues
to disrupt,

01:10:33.460 --> 01:10:35.668
spreading bad ideas
among our young.

01:10:38.168 --> 01:10:40.084
- It's bullshit.
- It's not true.

01:10:40.085 --> 01:10:41.334
She says he will only

01:10:41.335 --> 01:10:43.001
bring more death.

01:10:43.543 --> 01:10:44.625
Hey, why don't you

01:10:44.626 --> 01:10:45.751
say something?

01:10:46.626 --> 01:10:48.168
Just say something.
Please.

01:10:54.168 --> 01:10:56.417
She says the outcast

01:10:56.418 --> 01:10:57.709
may not stay in

01:10:57.710 --> 01:10:58.625
these waters.

01:10:58.626 --> 01:10:59.625
- He must go far...
- No.

01:10:59.626 --> 01:11:00.542
...where his Song

01:11:00.543 --> 01:11:01.960
cannot be heard.

01:11:02.501 --> 01:11:03.918
Exiled for life.

01:11:06.543 --> 01:11:07.543
That's not fair.

01:11:10.126 --> 01:11:11.001
It is decided.

01:11:16.626 --> 01:11:18.418
No! Payakan!

01:11:20.293 --> 01:11:21.667
Brother! Please.

01:11:21.668 --> 01:11:23.376
- No. Payakan!
- No.

01:11:23.960 --> 01:11:24.959
Brother!

01:11:31.585 --> 01:11:33.209
This is...
This is wrong!

01:11:33.210 --> 01:11:34.543
This is wrong!

01:11:35.626 --> 01:11:36.542
You do not

01:11:36.543 --> 01:11:37.542
speak here.

01:11:37.543 --> 01:11:39.459
No.
Payakan fought for us.

01:11:39.460 --> 01:11:41.084
- He fought for us.
- Lo'ak.

01:11:41.085 --> 01:11:42.209
He saved
your daughter's life.

01:11:42.210 --> 01:11:43.917
- This is council.
- He saved her life!

01:11:43.918 --> 01:11:45.667
- You do not speak.
- He defends us.

01:11:45.668 --> 01:11:47.042
- This is council.
- Lo'ak.

01:11:47.043 --> 01:11:48.292
The elders
have spoken.

01:11:48.293 --> 01:11:49.834
The tulkun are being hunted.

01:11:49.835 --> 01:11:50.710
They're dying.

01:11:51.501 --> 01:11:52.875
Lo'ak, that's enough.

01:11:52.876 --> 01:11:53.959
No!

01:11:53.960 --> 01:11:55.500
- Lo'ak speaks the truth!
- No, Tsireya.

01:11:55.501 --> 01:11:56.667
- No!
- Daughter!

01:11:56.668 --> 01:11:58.209
- Payakan is a warrior!
- Tsireya.

01:11:58.210 --> 01:11:59.625
He fought for us.

01:11:59.626 --> 01:12:01.585
More than you. Or you.

01:12:02.085 --> 01:12:03.250
More than any of you!

01:12:03.251 --> 01:12:04.584
- He fought for us!
- Sit down!

01:12:04.585 --> 01:12:06.125
Lo'ak.

01:12:06.126 --> 01:12:08.084
- Take him from here!
- You do not speak here, boy.

01:12:08.085 --> 01:12:09.167
- Make a hole.
- Dad!

01:12:09.168 --> 01:12:10.209
Listen to him!

01:12:10.210 --> 01:12:11.210
We are in council!

01:12:11.835 --> 01:12:12.917
The elders have spoken.

01:12:12.918 --> 01:12:14.960
What are you doing?

01:12:16.710 --> 01:12:17.876
You never stand up for me!

01:12:18.626 --> 01:12:20.001
- Be seated.
- Come with me.

01:12:21.918 --> 01:12:23.293
Council continues.

01:12:26.335 --> 01:12:28.376
We're at war.
You understand that?

01:12:28.918 --> 01:12:30.459
If you disobey orders,

01:12:30.460 --> 01:12:31.960
people get killed.

01:12:33.710 --> 01:12:35.709
With Spider here, we're trying
to keep a low profile.

01:12:35.710 --> 01:12:37.334
But that rogue
is out there.

01:12:37.335 --> 01:12:38.834
He's stirring up
the young bulls.

01:12:38.835 --> 01:12:40.626
He was going to bring
the whole RDA down on us.

01:12:42.126 --> 01:12:43.542
You want him gone.

01:12:43.543 --> 01:12:44.751
That's why
you didn't say anything.

01:12:45.418 --> 01:12:47.000
He's a loose cannon.

01:12:47.001 --> 01:12:48.875
He's just like you.
In fact, if you hadn't gone

01:12:48.876 --> 01:12:49.959
to him in the first place,

01:12:49.960 --> 01:12:51.084
if you hadn't
disobeyed orders,

01:12:51.085 --> 01:12:52.376
then your brother
would still be...

01:12:59.626 --> 01:13:01.375
That wasn't my fault.

01:13:01.376 --> 01:13:02.376
Dad, that...

01:13:04.668 --> 01:13:06.460
That's not my fault!

01:13:10.626 --> 01:13:11.626
Lo'ak.

01:13:28.376 --> 01:13:30.126
Go to him, Jake.

01:13:34.585 --> 01:13:36.251
Or you will lose
another son.

01:13:39.918 --> 01:13:41.626
I've got nothing
to say to him.

01:13:44.210 --> 01:13:45.585
Do not blame Lo'ak.

01:13:48.668 --> 01:13:50.875
You said you could
protect this family.

01:13:50.876 --> 01:13:52.126
That,
you could do.

01:13:53.460 --> 01:13:55.250
Yeah, I thought
we would be safe here.

01:13:55.251 --> 01:13:57.418
Our son is dead, Jake.

01:13:58.168 --> 01:13:59.418
I was wrong!

01:14:01.585 --> 01:14:02.750
What do you
want me to say?

01:14:02.751 --> 01:14:03.959
That every decision
that I made

01:14:03.960 --> 01:14:05.168
for this family is wrong?

01:14:06.210 --> 01:14:07.543
I killed our son?

01:14:13.043 --> 01:14:15.210
And still we are here
in this place,

01:14:16.043 --> 01:14:17.876
hiding this pink skin,

01:14:19.418 --> 01:14:20.500
this alien.

01:14:20.501 --> 01:14:21.792
If I had to choose

01:14:21.793 --> 01:14:24.126
between my family
and a pink skin,

01:14:24.751 --> 01:14:27.084
I would kill him
right now.

01:14:27.085 --> 01:14:28.917
Stop, stop, stop.

01:14:28.918 --> 01:14:30.417
We're not doing this.
Look.

01:14:30.418 --> 01:14:31.543
We're not doing this.

01:14:32.085 --> 01:14:33.667
You already chose

01:14:33.668 --> 01:14:35.959
between your family
and a pink skin once,

01:14:35.960 --> 01:14:37.418
remember?

01:14:41.210 --> 01:14:43.959
You cannot live
like this, baby.

01:14:43.960 --> 01:14:45.418
In hate.

01:14:46.960 --> 01:14:49.625
I hate them, Jake.
I hate them.

01:14:51.376 --> 01:14:52.709
I hate them.

01:14:52.710 --> 01:14:55.001
I hate their
pink little hands.

01:14:55.918 --> 01:14:58.626
I hate the insanity
in their minds.

01:15:01.835 --> 01:15:02.918
I'm a human.

01:15:03.585 --> 01:15:04.710
Inside.

01:15:05.210 --> 01:15:06.293
You hate me?

01:15:08.501 --> 01:15:10.626
I'll always be an alien
to you, won't I?

01:15:11.293 --> 01:15:13.293
Doesn't matter how long
I live in this skin.

01:15:15.668 --> 01:15:16.793
Do you hate your children?

01:15:18.876 --> 01:15:20.585
With their alien hands?

01:15:22.293 --> 01:15:23.293
No.

01:15:24.168 --> 01:15:25.418
Are you ashamed

01:15:26.043 --> 01:15:27.417
every time
they make a mistake,

01:15:27.418 --> 01:15:28.543
every time
they're different?

01:15:30.626 --> 01:15:31.709
That's because of

01:15:31.710 --> 01:15:33.460
the human
inside them, right?

01:15:35.918 --> 01:15:36.918
Yes.

01:15:55.501 --> 01:15:56.585
I'm sorry, baby.

01:15:57.585 --> 01:15:58.710
I'm sorry.

01:15:59.626 --> 01:16:00.626
I'm sorry.

01:16:04.085 --> 01:16:07.043
We have to stand strong
right now.

01:16:08.751 --> 01:16:10.668
This family is our fortress.

01:16:33.710 --> 01:16:35.710
The People say
that when you touch steel,

01:16:36.668 --> 01:16:38.376
its poison
seeps into your heart.

01:17:03.876 --> 01:17:04.876
Lo'ak!

01:17:05.793 --> 01:17:06.875
Brother.

01:17:06.876 --> 01:17:07.876
Lo'ak.

01:17:13.210 --> 01:17:15.459
Stay in this life,
Brother.

01:17:17.543 --> 01:17:18.834
We need you.

01:17:18.835 --> 01:17:20.459
We love you.

01:17:20.460 --> 01:17:22.084
You have greatness
in you.

01:17:37.960 --> 01:17:40.710
The strength of the
ancestors is here.

01:17:45.043 --> 01:17:46.376
A bow can be fixed.

01:18:03.751 --> 01:18:05.001
Good. Good.

01:18:13.918 --> 01:18:15.335
Moment of truth.

01:18:22.043 --> 01:18:24.626
Whoa.

01:18:27.335 --> 01:18:28.168
Go.

01:18:32.168 --> 01:18:33.876
You feel her?

01:18:34.460 --> 01:18:35.792
Hell yeah.

01:18:35.793 --> 01:18:37.085
I got fins.

01:18:38.168 --> 01:18:39.418
Yeah, you do.

01:18:40.085 --> 01:18:43.042
- Whoo!
- Whoo!

01:18:43.043 --> 01:18:44.793
Go, Monkey Boy!

01:18:56.251 --> 01:18:57.668
Whoo!

01:19:03.210 --> 01:19:04.792
You. Face down!

01:19:04.793 --> 01:19:05.793
Eyes on the ground.

01:19:06.960 --> 01:19:08.459
Stay calm, my people.

01:19:08.460 --> 01:19:09.460
Stay calm.

01:19:12.168 --> 01:19:14.375
Spider. Huh?

01:19:14.376 --> 01:19:15.834
I think we're wasting
our time, Colonel.

01:19:15.835 --> 01:19:17.793
- They don't know anything.
- Oh, they know.

01:19:18.585 --> 01:19:20.001
They're just not talking.

01:19:21.710 --> 01:19:23.584
We got one more play,

01:19:23.585 --> 01:19:25.084
but it's radical.

01:20:08.043 --> 01:20:09.918
Hey, you remember me,
don't you?

01:20:10.751 --> 01:20:12.709
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

01:20:12.710 --> 01:20:14.000
- Mine!
- Just relax.

01:20:14.001 --> 01:20:16.460
- Get him up.
- I brought something for your Tsahìk.

01:20:17.168 --> 01:20:19.709
- You take me to your Tsahì--
- Move!

01:20:19.710 --> 01:20:21.250
- Hey, hey!
- Move!

01:20:21.251 --> 01:20:22.750
No need to do that.

01:20:22.751 --> 01:20:24.585
- I got my eye on you.
- Keep going.

01:20:33.626 --> 01:20:34.626
Move!

01:20:42.460 --> 01:20:43.500
Tsahìk.

01:20:43.501 --> 01:20:45.043
What is he doing here?

01:20:48.543 --> 01:20:49.543
Tsahìk.

01:21:06.293 --> 01:21:08.251
I'll get you as many
as you want.

01:21:19.043 --> 01:21:21.875
What is your name,
Sky Man?

01:21:21.876 --> 01:21:23.043
Quaritch.

01:21:24.293 --> 01:21:26.376
Colonel Miles Quaritch.

01:21:29.293 --> 01:21:30.293
Hmm.

01:21:31.418 --> 01:21:33.710
You touch me with that
thing again, I'll kill you.

01:21:34.376 --> 01:21:36.750
You will kill no one.

01:21:38.376 --> 01:21:41.085
Lady, I'm gonna
beg to differ.

01:21:41.710 --> 01:21:42.710
Drop him.

01:22:06.793 --> 01:22:07.960
Good trick...

01:22:09.793 --> 01:22:10.793
Quaritch.

01:22:12.376 --> 01:22:14.417
You're next, cupcake.

01:22:14.418 --> 01:22:16.585
So think careful
about what you want to do.

01:22:19.668 --> 01:22:20.668
Come.

01:22:22.293 --> 01:22:24.168
We will talk inside.

01:22:30.543 --> 01:22:32.251
What are you doing, boss?

01:22:49.168 --> 01:22:50.168
Cozy.

01:22:53.168 --> 01:22:54.335
See, thing is...

01:22:56.751 --> 01:22:58.335
everybody's lying
to me.

01:23:04.876 --> 01:23:05.876
They say that

01:23:07.876 --> 01:23:10.335
you can make a stone
speak the truth.

01:23:10.918 --> 01:23:12.375
You seek a man,

01:23:12.376 --> 01:23:14.335
the other Sky Man
like you.

01:23:15.293 --> 01:23:16.543
Not like me.

01:23:17.876 --> 01:23:18.918
No,
he's a traitor.

01:23:20.668 --> 01:23:22.167
Well, then he must die.

01:23:24.585 --> 01:23:27.001
Varang can help you
find this man.

01:23:28.793 --> 01:23:30.376
And the other
you seek.

01:23:33.043 --> 01:23:34.043
This...

01:23:34.793 --> 01:23:36.000
air breather.

01:23:41.751 --> 01:23:43.000
First,

01:23:43.001 --> 01:23:44.792
I must see your soul.

01:23:46.001 --> 01:23:47.085
Be still.

01:23:49.001 --> 01:23:50.001
Be still.

01:23:56.210 --> 01:23:57.501
Whoa.

01:23:58.918 --> 01:24:00.834
Whoa. Whoa.

01:24:02.501 --> 01:24:03.626
Whoa.

01:24:13.418 --> 01:24:15.126
That's some strong shit.

01:24:51.085 --> 01:24:52.085
This...

01:24:54.001 --> 01:24:56.418
is the only pure thing
in this world.

01:24:59.918 --> 01:25:02.250
The fire came
from the mountain

01:25:02.251 --> 01:25:03.418
when I was little.

01:25:05.335 --> 01:25:07.168
Burned our forest.

01:25:09.126 --> 01:25:10.793
It took everything.

01:25:15.626 --> 01:25:18.585
My people were starving.

01:25:19.376 --> 01:25:21.335
They cried for help.

01:25:24.126 --> 01:25:27.085
But Eywa did not come.

01:25:29.793 --> 01:25:32.751
So I went to the fire.

01:25:35.668 --> 01:25:38.335
And I learned its way.

01:25:43.918 --> 01:25:46.418
I am the fire.

01:25:48.918 --> 01:25:51.375
By my hand,

01:25:51.376 --> 01:25:53.710
my people grow strong.

01:25:54.376 --> 01:25:57.417
We do not lie down
and die

01:25:57.418 --> 01:25:59.084
just because Eywa

01:25:59.085 --> 01:26:00.543
turns her back on us.

01:26:02.501 --> 01:26:05.335
We turn our back
on Eywa,

01:26:07.085 --> 01:26:08.668
a weak mother

01:26:09.876 --> 01:26:11.709
for weak children.

01:26:14.210 --> 01:26:17.250
We do not suck

01:26:17.251 --> 01:26:19.835
on the breast
of weakness.

01:26:24.251 --> 01:26:26.085
Now...

01:26:28.335 --> 01:26:30.459
only true words

01:26:30.460 --> 01:26:32.293
will come
from your tongue.

01:26:34.210 --> 01:26:35.210
Mmm.

01:26:39.043 --> 01:26:40.626
You have a strong heart.

01:26:41.626 --> 01:26:42.710
No fear.

01:26:43.501 --> 01:26:44.835
Ow.

01:26:45.710 --> 01:26:46.793
Ow.

01:26:47.293 --> 01:26:48.584
That wasn't cool.

01:26:48.585 --> 01:26:51.375
I will eat
your heart, Quaritch.

01:26:51.376 --> 01:26:53.501
Oh.

01:26:57.168 --> 01:27:00.335
But first,
you will answer me.

01:27:04.251 --> 01:27:06.085
Why are you here?

01:27:11.126 --> 01:27:12.501
I'm here for you.

01:27:14.460 --> 01:27:16.418
You wish to serve me?

01:27:17.835 --> 01:27:19.251
I don't serve
anybody.

01:27:21.501 --> 01:27:22.668
I need you.

01:27:24.126 --> 01:27:26.168
Well, I do not
need you.

01:27:27.126 --> 01:27:29.001
But I might keep you

01:27:29.585 --> 01:27:31.251
as my slave

01:27:31.876 --> 01:27:33.251
to pleasure me.

01:27:34.168 --> 01:27:37.043
That sounds like
a fun weekend, but...

01:27:38.210 --> 01:27:40.750
that's not what
you really want.

01:27:40.751 --> 01:27:42.668
And what do I want?

01:27:44.626 --> 01:27:46.126
What you've never had.

01:27:48.668 --> 01:27:49.751
An equal.

01:27:54.085 --> 01:27:55.834
You want to spread
your fire

01:27:55.835 --> 01:27:56.793
across the world.

01:27:57.501 --> 01:27:58.626
Yeah.

01:27:59.876 --> 01:28:01.834
I'll give you guns.

01:28:01.835 --> 01:28:03.126
I'll give you comms.

01:28:04.043 --> 01:28:06.000
RPGs.

01:28:06.001 --> 01:28:07.793
Oh, that's strong magic.

01:28:08.960 --> 01:28:10.834
Command from a distance,

01:28:10.835 --> 01:28:12.501
strike like lightning.

01:28:14.043 --> 01:28:15.210
The clans...

01:28:16.251 --> 01:28:18.126
as far as you can fly,

01:28:19.668 --> 01:28:21.959
they'll bow down
before Varang.

01:28:28.168 --> 01:28:29.835
You want to
take on Eywa...

01:28:32.001 --> 01:28:33.126
you need me.

01:28:38.960 --> 01:28:40.210
I See you.

01:28:42.251 --> 01:28:43.793
Damn right you do.

01:30:03.460 --> 01:30:05.667
When I can connect again,

01:30:05.668 --> 01:30:06.835
someday,

01:30:07.876 --> 01:30:09.168
whenever,

01:30:09.668 --> 01:30:12.210
I can be your guide
in the Spirit World.

01:30:13.585 --> 01:30:16.334
Well, can I just go now?

01:30:16.335 --> 01:30:17.292
No.

01:30:17.293 --> 01:30:19.375
Not without me.

01:30:19.376 --> 01:30:21.543
A Sky Person
can't just show up.

01:30:22.376 --> 01:30:24.251
It'd freak out
the ancestors.

01:30:34.543 --> 01:30:36.959
They're starting to arrive

01:30:36.960 --> 01:30:38.667
for the Calf Communion.

01:30:40.543 --> 01:30:41.875
Yearling calves

01:30:41.876 --> 01:30:44.335
and reef babies together

01:30:45.043 --> 01:30:46.959
having their first bond
with Eywa.

01:30:46.960 --> 01:30:48.210
It'll be so beautiful.

01:31:16.043 --> 01:31:17.043
Let me see.

01:31:19.585 --> 01:31:21.250
Looks good.

01:31:21.251 --> 01:31:22.875
I like this on you.

01:31:22.876 --> 01:31:23.876
Come to the festival.

01:31:24.418 --> 01:31:25.501
No, no, no, no.

01:31:27.168 --> 01:31:28.876
Then I will just
stay here with you.

01:31:36.876 --> 01:31:39.668
Lo'ak, I should not
tell you this, but...

01:31:40.793 --> 01:31:42.126
my tulkun Sister says

01:31:42.751 --> 01:31:44.459
they have been
hearing Payakan,

01:31:44.460 --> 01:31:46.917
very faint,
calling to his birth clan.

01:31:46.918 --> 01:31:47.918
Where?

01:31:49.335 --> 01:31:52.085
Tulkun Song travels very far
through the water, Lo'ak.

01:31:52.585 --> 01:31:53.626
Please.

01:32:23.335 --> 01:32:24.710
Lo'ak.

01:32:28.835 --> 01:32:29.835
Bye, Mom.

01:32:31.210 --> 01:32:32.293
Where are you going?

01:32:34.626 --> 01:32:35.626
Just out.

01:32:38.001 --> 01:32:39.460
There's something
I have to do.

01:32:47.668 --> 01:32:48.668
Lo'ak!

01:32:51.085 --> 01:32:52.085
Lo'ak!

01:32:54.251 --> 01:32:55.376
Lo'ak, wait!

01:32:57.251 --> 01:32:58.251
Lo'ak.

01:33:14.876 --> 01:33:16.125
We cannot go.

01:33:16.126 --> 01:33:17.542
The Calf Communion
is in five days.

01:33:17.543 --> 01:33:20.542
I have to go.
This is my fault.

01:33:20.543 --> 01:33:21.626
We are going.

01:33:22.960 --> 01:33:24.001
All of us.

01:33:24.751 --> 01:33:26.834
Get weapons and food.

01:33:26.835 --> 01:33:27.835
Tell no one.

01:33:35.335 --> 01:33:37.085
Our children have gone
to look for him.

01:33:38.126 --> 01:33:39.126
You let them?

01:33:39.710 --> 01:33:41.043
They did not ask.

01:33:41.585 --> 01:33:42.792
All right,
we'll get the riders.

01:33:42.793 --> 01:33:44.000
We'll go after them.

01:33:44.001 --> 01:33:45.750
We cannot search
the whole ocean.

01:33:45.751 --> 01:33:47.792
We need the warriors here
for Calf Communion

01:33:47.793 --> 01:33:49.210
if the demon ships come.

01:33:49.876 --> 01:33:51.460
My boy is out there
by himself.

01:33:53.043 --> 01:33:55.751
He will come back
when he is ready.

01:33:56.710 --> 01:33:58.418
This is his path.

01:34:03.210 --> 01:34:04.626
Look at what he did.

01:34:06.293 --> 01:34:07.793
Jake, the strength
of the ancestors

01:34:08.460 --> 01:34:10.293
runs in your son's veins.

01:34:11.460 --> 01:34:12.793
You must trust that.

01:34:19.085 --> 01:34:20.292
The way of water

01:34:20.293 --> 01:34:21.335
has no beginning...

01:34:24.751 --> 01:34:25.834
and no end.

01:34:25.835 --> 01:34:26.835
The sea is your home...

01:34:32.418 --> 01:34:33.460
before your birth...

01:34:40.460 --> 01:34:41.835
and after your death.

01:35:04.126 --> 01:35:06.084
Where is the one

01:35:06.085 --> 01:35:07.876
they call
Toruk Makto?

01:35:08.418 --> 01:35:10.250
How many fish
are in the sea?

01:35:10.251 --> 01:35:11.167
One, two.

01:35:11.168 --> 01:35:13.084
How many birds are in the sky?

01:35:13.085 --> 01:35:14.625
One, two, three--

01:35:15.918 --> 01:35:17.459
I mean, come on,
you couldn't have asked Eywa

01:35:17.460 --> 01:35:18.917
to make me
a little bit taller?

01:35:18.918 --> 01:35:20.209
Maybe even
a little bit more blue.

01:35:20.210 --> 01:35:21.251
No.

01:35:21.793 --> 01:35:23.959
I was busy
saving your life.

01:35:23.960 --> 01:35:25.042
Skxawng.

01:35:25.043 --> 01:35:26.542
Just a little bit.

01:35:26.543 --> 01:35:27.710
A couple of centimeters.

01:35:29.668 --> 01:35:31.000
She's the All Mother.

01:35:31.001 --> 01:35:32.085
She can do anything.

01:35:34.585 --> 01:35:35.834
You are perfect

01:35:35.835 --> 01:35:37.418
just the way you are.

01:35:57.418 --> 01:35:58.668
Come on, Monkey Boy.

01:36:02.043 --> 01:36:03.125
So next thing is,

01:36:03.126 --> 01:36:04.460
I'm going to learn
how to ride a skimwing.

01:36:05.501 --> 01:36:07.625
So you can become
a mighty warrior

01:36:07.626 --> 01:36:08.917
and protect us all.

01:36:08.918 --> 01:36:10.792
Hey, it's not the size
of the dog in the fight,

01:36:10.793 --> 01:36:12.251
it's the size of the fight
in the dog.

01:36:13.335 --> 01:36:14.168
What is it?

01:36:16.543 --> 01:36:18.043
Sh--

01:36:21.376 --> 01:36:22.210
Run!

01:36:22.710 --> 01:36:23.585
Run!

01:36:30.293 --> 01:36:31.460
Hurry!

01:36:32.835 --> 01:36:33.876
Go. Go!

01:36:35.668 --> 01:36:36.501
Spider.

01:36:37.085 --> 01:36:38.459
Over here, assholes!

01:36:40.543 --> 01:36:41.750
Come on!

01:36:41.751 --> 01:36:42.835
Hey, skxawng!

01:36:43.668 --> 01:36:44.835
This way, you bastards!

01:36:46.835 --> 01:36:48.085
Come on, dipshits!

01:36:49.001 --> 01:36:50.417
Is that all you got?

01:36:52.043 --> 01:36:53.043
Shit!

01:36:55.043 --> 01:36:55.917
Hey, hey!

01:36:55.918 --> 01:36:57.543
Settle down there, cowboy.

01:36:58.085 --> 01:37:00.167
Careful with that knife.
That's how people get hurt.

01:37:02.626 --> 01:37:04.335
Air breather.

01:37:19.085 --> 01:37:20.375
We fly.

01:37:20.376 --> 01:37:21.376
Break off.

01:37:22.210 --> 01:37:24.668
Dragonfly, Blue One.
You are cleared in.

01:37:39.793 --> 01:37:41.168
- What is it?
- Tuk!

01:37:48.710 --> 01:37:50.417
They're blocking us in.
Weapons up.

01:37:50.418 --> 01:37:51.417
Weapons!

01:37:51.418 --> 01:37:52.667
Where's your sister?

01:37:52.668 --> 01:37:53.792
She went for water.

01:37:53.793 --> 01:37:55.168
Where's Kiri?
Where's Spider?

01:37:56.043 --> 01:37:58.376
Dad!

01:37:59.168 --> 01:38:00.709
- Where's Spider?
- They took him.

01:38:00.710 --> 01:38:02.626
The blue colonel took him.

01:38:15.626 --> 01:38:16.626
Take him.

01:38:37.460 --> 01:38:38.626
Be calm.

01:38:39.168 --> 01:38:40.543
No fear.

01:38:41.293 --> 01:38:42.293
No fear!

01:38:49.876 --> 01:38:51.168
Jake Sully!

01:38:52.668 --> 01:38:54.375
Take the girls,
and you go now!

01:38:54.376 --> 01:38:55.501
I will not go without you.

01:38:56.126 --> 01:38:58.042
No. They got Spider.

01:38:58.043 --> 01:38:59.209
There's nothing
holding them back.

01:38:59.210 --> 01:39:00.335
You've seen
what they can do.

01:39:01.001 --> 01:39:02.459
These people will die.

01:39:02.460 --> 01:39:04.417
You cannot ask this.

01:39:04.418 --> 01:39:06.001
Husband, I cannot.

01:39:07.626 --> 01:39:09.418
This is the only way.

01:39:10.210 --> 01:39:11.584
Jake Sully!

01:39:11.585 --> 01:39:13.584
Show yourself!

01:39:13.585 --> 01:39:15.625
You got to go.
You got to go right now.

01:39:15.626 --> 01:39:17.710
Take your sister. Go and hide.

01:39:18.626 --> 01:39:19.709
Go!

01:39:21.085 --> 01:39:22.500
If you stay, I stay.

01:39:22.501 --> 01:39:24.250
I will kill many!

01:39:24.251 --> 01:39:26.626
Whatever happens,
do not raise that bow.

01:39:27.168 --> 01:39:28.585
You swear to me.

01:39:31.626 --> 01:39:33.292
I know he's here.

01:39:33.293 --> 01:39:34.584
Give him to me.

01:39:34.585 --> 01:39:36.334
He is Metkayina.

01:39:36.335 --> 01:39:37.501
He is one of us.

01:39:38.126 --> 01:39:39.543
He is one of us!

01:39:40.460 --> 01:39:42.167
Burn something.

01:39:42.168 --> 01:39:43.875
Dragon 2-4,
lay down some incendiary

01:39:43.876 --> 01:39:46.000
- on the center village.
- Copy.

01:39:46.001 --> 01:39:47.251
Switching incendiaries.

01:40:03.376 --> 01:40:05.335
I want Jake Sully!

01:40:06.710 --> 01:40:08.834
Stop. No.
Hold your fire.

01:40:08.835 --> 01:40:10.626
Hold your fire. Stop.

01:40:11.418 --> 01:40:12.418
Hold fire.

01:40:13.835 --> 01:40:15.085
Copy.
Breaking off.

01:40:17.543 --> 01:40:18.959
This is my path,
Brother.

01:40:37.085 --> 01:40:38.335
Colonel.

01:40:39.043 --> 01:40:40.043
Corporal.

01:40:40.668 --> 01:40:42.209
You take me,

01:40:42.210 --> 01:40:44.126
and you leave my family
and these people alone.

01:40:44.710 --> 01:40:46.459
Not good
enough.

01:40:46.460 --> 01:40:48.293
Going to need
the missus too.

01:40:52.460 --> 01:40:53.751
You get me.

01:40:54.543 --> 01:40:57.501
Both of you or I
hammer this place flat.

01:40:58.335 --> 01:41:00.792
Pregnant ladies, kids.

01:41:00.793 --> 01:41:02.500
I'll blow grandma's
skinny shit

01:41:02.501 --> 01:41:03.709
through the back
of the hooch

01:41:03.710 --> 01:41:05.125
'cause I just don't care.

01:41:05.126 --> 01:41:07.375
And my pals here, well,

01:41:07.376 --> 01:41:09.209
they're just dying
to waste everybody

01:41:09.210 --> 01:41:10.792
and take some scalps.

01:41:27.501 --> 01:41:28.793
Really?

01:41:29.960 --> 01:41:31.251
We doing this?

01:41:31.918 --> 01:41:33.750
When I drop my arm,

01:41:33.751 --> 01:41:35.959
you and your
new girlfriend die.

01:41:35.960 --> 01:41:37.959
You in particular
die a lot.

01:41:37.960 --> 01:41:40.584
I die, everybody
here dies.

01:41:40.585 --> 01:41:41.793
Maybe.

01:41:42.460 --> 01:41:45.292
I think you can get some
of us but not all of us.

01:41:45.293 --> 01:41:46.584
Maybe we bum rush ya,

01:41:46.585 --> 01:41:47.709
and your gunships
hesitate

01:41:47.710 --> 01:41:49.501
'cause we all
look the same.

01:41:50.085 --> 01:41:51.792
And then
when you're begging

01:41:51.793 --> 01:41:53.210
for your life...

01:41:54.626 --> 01:41:55.918
...I'll scalp you.

01:41:57.168 --> 01:41:58.960
Well, damn, Corporal.

01:41:59.668 --> 01:42:02.750
I don't know if you're smart
or just shit nuts.

01:42:02.751 --> 01:42:05.125
You never struck me
as all that smart.

01:42:06.293 --> 01:42:08.959
I need your word,
marine to marine.

01:42:08.960 --> 01:42:10.043
Safety

01:42:11.001 --> 01:42:12.418
for these people.

01:42:13.001 --> 01:42:14.917
Burn them all, Quaritch.

01:42:24.418 --> 01:42:25.835
Do we have a deal?

01:42:30.710 --> 01:42:31.710
Done.

01:42:33.126 --> 01:42:34.793
Want to pinky swear?

01:42:44.043 --> 01:42:45.043
Take him.

01:42:46.751 --> 01:42:47.751
Turn around.

01:42:53.793 --> 01:42:54.793
Move.

01:43:13.793 --> 01:43:14.960
- Let's go.
- Come on.

01:43:15.960 --> 01:43:17.167
Another time then,

01:43:17.168 --> 01:43:18.250
Mrs. Sully.

01:43:22.543 --> 01:43:23.625
Saddle up.

01:44:06.876 --> 01:44:07.959
What do we got?

01:44:07.960 --> 01:44:09.584
Ma'am, we have
a big incursion.

01:44:09.585 --> 01:44:11.375
- Banshee riders inbound.
- I see that.

01:44:11.376 --> 01:44:12.834
- So light 'em up.
- I can't, ma'am.

01:44:12.835 --> 01:44:14.375
Weapons locked out.

01:44:14.376 --> 01:44:16.001
They all have
IFF badges.

01:44:16.626 --> 01:44:17.667
Expand it.

01:44:17.668 --> 01:44:19.418
Echo 1-6,
intersect the target.

01:45:08.501 --> 01:45:09.917
All right. All right.

01:45:09.918 --> 01:45:11.084
Hold him there.

01:45:11.085 --> 01:45:12.667
Easy, easy.

01:45:12.668 --> 01:45:13.710
Let's go.

01:45:15.501 --> 01:45:16.625
- Jake!
- Grab him.

01:45:16.626 --> 01:45:18.125
Let's go. Move.

01:45:18.126 --> 01:45:20.584
- Jake! Jake!
- Bring him in.

01:45:24.085 --> 01:45:25.085
Jake!

01:45:25.751 --> 01:45:26.751
Up.

01:45:42.210 --> 01:45:43.960
Mission accomplished,
General.

01:45:44.626 --> 01:45:45.959
Jake Sully.

01:45:45.960 --> 01:45:47.793
Toruk Makto himself.

01:46:02.543 --> 01:46:04.876
It's not enough for you
to hand out guns,

01:46:05.460 --> 01:46:08.459
you've got to bring hostiles
inside the perimeter.

01:46:10.460 --> 01:46:11.875
Not hostiles.

01:46:11.876 --> 01:46:13.126
Allies.

01:46:13.918 --> 01:46:16.542
General Ardmore,
I'd like you to meet Varang,

01:46:16.543 --> 01:46:18.335
Tsahìk of the Mangkwan.

01:46:21.585 --> 01:46:24.375
Let me make this very clear,
Colonel Cochise,

01:46:24.376 --> 01:46:26.167
I want every one
of these savages

01:46:26.168 --> 01:46:27.959
escorted off my base

01:46:27.960 --> 01:46:29.084
ASAP,

01:46:29.085 --> 01:46:31.376
including your little
missy over here.

01:46:37.793 --> 01:46:39.460
Don't be a jackass,
General.

01:46:41.335 --> 01:46:42.460
Take the win.

01:46:44.710 --> 01:46:45.710
We got him,
people!

01:46:47.126 --> 01:46:48.918
Huh?

01:46:49.960 --> 01:46:51.418
End of an era!

01:47:06.918 --> 01:47:08.167
Yeah!

01:47:08.168 --> 01:47:09.085
Whoo!

01:47:09.585 --> 01:47:10.584
Tsahìk.

01:47:13.168 --> 01:47:14.168
Let's go.

01:47:31.501 --> 01:47:32.668
Easy, easy.

01:47:39.668 --> 01:47:41.335
You'll just feel this
a little bit.

01:47:42.543 --> 01:47:43.542
Hold still.

01:47:46.085 --> 01:47:47.085
Almost there.

01:47:48.460 --> 01:47:50.251
- Good. Hold it there.
- Another few seconds.

01:47:55.835 --> 01:47:56.835
Payakan!

01:48:00.376 --> 01:48:01.376
Payakan!

01:48:08.418 --> 01:48:09.417
The People say

01:48:09.418 --> 01:48:11.459
the sea washes you clean.

01:48:11.460 --> 01:48:12.501
Payakan!

01:48:15.751 --> 01:48:16.834
It's Lo'ak.

01:48:16.835 --> 01:48:17.792
- It's him.
- Lo'ak.

01:48:17.793 --> 01:48:18.917
- It's him.
- Lo'ak!

01:48:18.918 --> 01:48:20.167
Skxawng, over here.

01:48:20.168 --> 01:48:21.250
Lo'ak!

01:48:21.251 --> 01:48:22.292
Tsireya!

01:48:26.501 --> 01:48:29.167
They also say,
if you see the deep ones,

01:48:29.168 --> 01:48:30.335
the Tsyong...

01:48:33.418 --> 01:48:35.251
they're spirits
sent to judge you.

01:48:48.126 --> 01:48:49.460
- Tsyong!
- Go, go, go.

01:50:04.835 --> 01:50:06.834
Lo'ak. Lo'ak.

01:50:06.835 --> 01:50:08.585
Lo'ak! Lo'ak!

01:50:13.085 --> 01:50:14.085
Tsireya.

01:50:20.001 --> 01:50:21.418
Thank you,
Great Mother.

01:50:22.418 --> 01:50:23.500
Come on,
let him breathe.

01:50:23.501 --> 01:50:24.584
Let him go.

01:50:28.751 --> 01:50:30.292
Can't believe you guys
came after me.

01:50:31.710 --> 01:50:33.335
My friend's path
is my path.

01:50:37.251 --> 01:50:38.334
Is this your Sister?

01:50:38.335 --> 01:50:39.335
Yes.

01:50:40.543 --> 01:50:42.542
What about Payakan?
Does she hear him?

01:50:42.543 --> 01:50:45.001
He is close.
He is coming now.

01:50:51.918 --> 01:50:52.918
So, what have
you got?

01:50:54.043 --> 01:50:56.459
Uh, this mycelium that's
living inside his body--

01:50:56.460 --> 01:50:57.959
Wait, there's something
living inside of him?

01:50:57.960 --> 01:50:59.834
Yes, it's an endosymbiont.

01:50:59.835 --> 01:51:01.542
It's somehow moderating
the ion exchange--

01:51:01.543 --> 01:51:03.542
Okay, stop. I don't need
to know how it works.

01:51:03.543 --> 01:51:05.376
I just need to know
if we can duplicate it.

01:51:11.501 --> 01:51:13.251
Let me out of here,
you jerk-offs!

01:51:17.710 --> 01:51:19.042
I told those
rubber-gloved pukes

01:51:19.043 --> 01:51:20.834
to lay off you
for a while.

01:51:20.835 --> 01:51:21.835
Where's Jake?

01:51:23.085 --> 01:51:24.959
He's locked up,
where he belongs.

01:51:24.960 --> 01:51:25.960
Here.

01:51:27.085 --> 01:51:29.125
I brought you a burger.

01:51:29.126 --> 01:51:30.292
You better not hurt him.

01:51:30.293 --> 01:51:32.085
He's not part
of your life anymore.

01:51:33.126 --> 01:51:34.459
You're with me now.

01:51:35.876 --> 01:51:36.876
I'm your father.

01:51:37.418 --> 01:51:38.585
My father's dead.

01:51:39.293 --> 01:51:41.959
You're just
some made-up thing

01:51:41.960 --> 01:51:43.459
they gave
his memories to.

01:51:43.460 --> 01:51:45.167
No, no. No.

01:51:45.168 --> 01:51:48.042
I'm still me.
I checked.

01:51:48.043 --> 01:51:49.085
Yeah, look.

01:51:50.085 --> 01:51:51.417
"Colonel
Miles Quaritch."

01:51:52.626 --> 01:51:53.626
Deceased.

01:51:58.460 --> 01:51:59.584
You know, we
didn't get a chance

01:51:59.585 --> 01:52:00.667
to talk too much

01:52:00.668 --> 01:52:02.793
when we were out in
the bush together, but, uh...

01:52:04.376 --> 01:52:05.625
I gotta thank you.

01:52:05.626 --> 01:52:08.835
I mean, you hauled me
out of a sunken ship.

01:52:09.876 --> 01:52:11.043
You saved my life.

01:52:11.835 --> 01:52:13.668
Yeah. Sure wish
I hadn't done that.

01:52:15.793 --> 01:52:16.960
Maybe that's true.

01:52:18.168 --> 01:52:19.626
Maybe, deep down,
it isn't.

01:52:20.293 --> 01:52:21.376
Either way,

01:52:22.293 --> 01:52:23.542
I owe you.

01:52:23.543 --> 01:52:26.210
And I gotta tell you
that, uh...

01:52:27.960 --> 01:52:29.668
Man, I'm proud of you.

01:52:32.126 --> 01:52:33.960
You're an amazing kid.
You got...

01:52:34.835 --> 01:52:37.126
guts, smarts, and...

01:52:38.293 --> 01:52:40.293
Son, you've got the heart
of a lion.

01:52:42.043 --> 01:52:44.585
I see myself in you.
Oh, yeah.

01:52:46.585 --> 01:52:48.835
I tell you
who I really see in you,

01:52:49.460 --> 01:52:50.542
and that's your mother.

01:52:51.710 --> 01:52:52.792
Oh, man.

01:52:52.793 --> 01:52:55.293
She was, uh, ferocious.

01:52:56.918 --> 01:52:58.460
Tough to live with, but...

01:53:00.210 --> 01:53:01.500
I loved her.

01:53:01.501 --> 01:53:04.001
And, man,
did she love you.

01:53:06.793 --> 01:53:07.959
Hardest thing
she ever did

01:53:07.960 --> 01:53:10.209
was climbing aboard
that gunship that day,

01:53:10.210 --> 01:53:11.543
going into battle,

01:53:12.251 --> 01:53:14.334
leaving her
little baby behind.

01:53:17.001 --> 01:53:18.876
Your mom died
a hero, Son.

01:53:20.793 --> 01:53:21.875
You got that

01:53:21.876 --> 01:53:22.876
in you too.

01:53:25.210 --> 01:53:26.167
Anyway,

01:53:26.168 --> 01:53:27.334
I didn't come down here

01:53:27.335 --> 01:53:28.834
to take a trip down
memory lane.

01:53:28.835 --> 01:53:31.043
I just came by to tell you
that I'm here for you.

01:53:32.376 --> 01:53:34.710
If you need me.

01:53:37.168 --> 01:53:38.335
I'm here for you.

01:53:42.210 --> 01:53:43.251
Can I keep it?

01:53:54.126 --> 01:53:55.376
Eat something, will you?

01:54:06.793 --> 01:54:07.793
Brother!

01:54:15.043 --> 01:54:16.626
I See you, Brother.

01:54:22.918 --> 01:54:23.917
What is it?

01:54:23.918 --> 01:54:24.835
What's wrong?

01:54:30.168 --> 01:54:31.876
Didn't you find
your birth clan?

01:55:00.043 --> 01:55:01.793
Tulkun are
already coming in,

01:55:02.710 --> 01:55:05.542
but the aggregation doesn't
peak until the eclipse,

01:55:05.543 --> 01:55:07.375
which is the day
after tomorrow,

01:55:07.376 --> 01:55:09.168
and that's
when we hit 'em.

01:55:09.751 --> 01:55:11.459
No, no, hold on.
No...

01:55:11.460 --> 01:55:13.875
- you're talking about wholesale slaughter.
- Uh-huh.

01:55:13.876 --> 01:55:16.084
Hundreds killed.
Entire pods just wiped out.

01:55:16.085 --> 01:55:18.250
That's the beauty
of the idea.

01:55:18.251 --> 01:55:19.917
We'll fill a year's quota
in just one day.

01:55:19.918 --> 01:55:22.043
These are intelligent,
soulful beings.

01:55:22.626 --> 01:55:23.626
Who are you?

01:55:24.126 --> 01:55:26.668
Ian... Ian Garvin.
Marine biologist.

01:55:28.751 --> 01:55:29.834
These creatures,

01:55:29.835 --> 01:55:31.750
they have culture,
they have music,

01:55:31.751 --> 01:55:32.959
they have names
for each other.

01:55:32.960 --> 01:55:34.042
This is organized.

01:55:34.043 --> 01:55:36.042
This aggregation
is deliberate.

01:55:36.043 --> 01:55:38.250
It's a spiritual gathering
for them--

01:55:38.251 --> 01:55:39.584
Get off your high horse,
Garvin.

01:55:39.585 --> 01:55:40.667
We all made our deals.

01:55:40.668 --> 01:55:42.750
No, I did not sign up
for this!

01:55:42.751 --> 01:55:43.917
Dr. Garvin.

01:55:43.918 --> 01:55:45.125
Dr. Garvin, thank you.

01:55:45.126 --> 01:55:46.667
Your protest
has been noted.

01:55:46.668 --> 01:55:48.085
- Oh, it's been noted?
- Yes.

01:55:49.168 --> 01:55:51.125
Sub teams
and fast boats,

01:55:51.126 --> 01:55:53.417
you guys will form
a cordon.

01:55:53.418 --> 01:55:54.625
You'll drive
the family groups

01:55:54.626 --> 01:55:57.167
in here to where it forms
a natural choke point

01:55:57.168 --> 01:55:58.460
against the islands.

01:56:07.835 --> 01:56:09.125
We got you, Sully!

01:56:09.126 --> 01:56:10.418
I can't believe we got him.

01:56:12.251 --> 01:56:13.460
Hey!
Make a hole.

01:56:15.251 --> 01:56:16.251
Open up.

01:56:17.751 --> 01:56:18.751
Weapon, sir.

01:56:27.710 --> 01:56:29.126
End of the line, Jake.

01:56:30.751 --> 01:56:32.085
Zero-six tomorrow.

01:56:34.710 --> 01:56:36.125
Varang wants your heart,

01:56:36.126 --> 01:56:38.501
but I'm going old-school.

01:56:39.043 --> 01:56:40.210
Firing squad.

01:56:41.376 --> 01:56:43.835
Selfridge says
it's a "better optic."

01:56:44.793 --> 01:56:47.001
Yeah. Well, you be
a good dog for the suits.

01:56:49.460 --> 01:56:51.000
This isn't
about them.

01:56:54.543 --> 01:56:55.835
It's about me
and you.

01:56:57.251 --> 01:56:59.501
About a marine
that betrayed my trust.

01:57:00.668 --> 01:57:03.168
About the men
and women I lost.

01:57:08.460 --> 01:57:10.210
Dead man's memories.

01:57:13.168 --> 01:57:14.250
Miles Quaritch

01:57:14.251 --> 01:57:15.376
is gone.

01:57:17.293 --> 01:57:19.043
You're free,

01:57:19.668 --> 01:57:22.000
and there is a world out there.

01:57:22.001 --> 01:57:24.084
There's things that those suits

01:57:24.085 --> 01:57:25.668
will never understand.

01:57:27.376 --> 01:57:30.792
The Na'vi call it kame, "to See."

01:57:42.085 --> 01:57:43.751
And See this world.

01:57:46.918 --> 01:57:48.168
See yourself.

01:57:52.501 --> 01:57:53.501
I'll see you...

01:57:55.043 --> 01:57:56.460
at zero-six.

01:58:52.293 --> 01:58:53.709
Last time,
I got two.

01:58:53.710 --> 01:58:54.709
Yeah,
but they were

01:58:54.710 --> 01:58:56.543
the ugliest ones
in the village.

01:59:14.543 --> 01:59:16.210
Open. Watch him.

01:59:17.043 --> 01:59:19.375
Hands on the wall. Hands on the wall.

01:59:24.085 --> 01:59:26.085
- All right, we're good.
- Close it. Go.

01:59:38.126 --> 01:59:40.335
It's nothing. Just one
of Quaritch's scouts.

02:00:10.710 --> 02:00:11.918
Watch for me.

02:00:33.460 --> 02:00:36.043
Okay, you've got a PhD.

02:00:36.793 --> 02:00:38.293
How hard can it be?

02:00:48.376 --> 02:00:50.292
Ah,
it's not crazy, man. If I was

02:00:50.293 --> 02:00:52.209
- four or five feet taller.
- Yeah.

02:00:52.210 --> 02:00:55.042
Felt the suckers, but
they're sharp as blades too.

02:00:55.043 --> 02:00:56.043
They're not soft.

02:00:56.835 --> 02:00:58.250
Guys, we're gonna go
grab drinks.

02:00:58.251 --> 02:00:59.585
Check this out.

02:01:03.710 --> 02:01:04.875
What's up, cutie?

02:01:07.835 --> 02:01:09.417
- She wants me.
- Ah.

02:01:09.418 --> 02:01:10.418
What?

02:01:11.793 --> 02:01:13.126
Hey.

02:01:17.043 --> 02:01:18.960
Quaritch.

02:01:22.793 --> 02:01:25.042
We are the fire.
Mangkwan.

02:01:32.168 --> 02:01:34.335
Quaritch.

02:01:38.460 --> 02:01:41.125
Make no sound, witch.

02:01:41.126 --> 02:01:42.334
Where is Jakesully?

02:01:42.335 --> 02:01:45.625
Ah, the wife.
Loyal to her man.

02:01:45.626 --> 02:01:47.626
Speak or I cut.

02:01:51.626 --> 02:01:52.835
Where?

02:01:53.335 --> 02:01:55.210
I will not ask again.

02:01:57.960 --> 02:01:59.292
No, wait.

02:01:59.293 --> 02:02:01.250
Wait.

02:02:01.251 --> 02:02:02.376
Past the camp.

02:02:03.585 --> 02:02:04.917
A cage for an animal.

02:02:04.918 --> 02:02:06.251
Take me there.

02:02:07.460 --> 02:02:08.750
Move. Which way?

02:02:08.751 --> 02:02:09.751
Hey, sugar!

02:02:14.251 --> 02:02:15.126
Join the party.

02:02:27.460 --> 02:02:28.959
Get after her.

02:02:28.960 --> 02:02:30.168
I want her heart!

02:02:44.376 --> 02:02:45.376
Go, go, go.

02:03:01.710 --> 02:03:02.835
Take cover!

02:03:03.418 --> 02:03:04.960
- Watch out.
- Clear the area!

02:03:16.960 --> 02:03:17.960
Jake!

02:03:20.585 --> 02:03:21.625
General.

02:03:21.626 --> 02:03:23.209
- Not now. I have a situation.
- No...

02:03:23.210 --> 02:03:24.667
I have a situation.

02:03:24.668 --> 02:03:26.875
The kid is loose,
and I need him back.

02:03:26.876 --> 02:03:28.085
Alive.

02:03:36.876 --> 02:03:38.084
Light her up.

02:04:22.668 --> 02:04:24.668
Hey. Whoa.

02:04:25.585 --> 02:04:26.543
Stop. Stop!

02:04:30.168 --> 02:04:31.918
Out of the way, guys.
Move it.

02:04:33.918 --> 02:04:35.793
Fire.
Hit him.

02:04:37.710 --> 02:04:39.418
Out of the way, guys.

02:04:46.626 --> 02:04:47.960
Blade down.

02:04:54.960 --> 02:04:55.960
Go, Jake.

02:04:59.751 --> 02:05:01.125
Light him up.

02:05:04.418 --> 02:05:05.460
Reverse.

02:05:09.293 --> 02:05:10.460
Gotcha.

02:05:15.043 --> 02:05:16.709
Aim for the cameras.

02:05:16.710 --> 02:05:18.626
Okay. Stay with me.

02:05:26.585 --> 02:05:27.918
Stay with me.

02:05:33.585 --> 02:05:36.251
What am I doing?

02:05:47.876 --> 02:05:49.001
Go! Back up.

02:05:58.168 --> 02:06:00.126
Is my protest
noted now, fuckers?

02:06:08.585 --> 02:06:09.793
Jake,

02:06:10.501 --> 02:06:11.875
this way.

02:06:11.876 --> 02:06:13.250
No. No, this way.
This way.

02:06:13.251 --> 02:06:14.085
- Come on.
- Okay.

02:06:17.168 --> 02:06:18.668
Ian Garvin, marine bio.

02:06:19.293 --> 02:06:20.542
Oh.

02:06:20.543 --> 02:06:22.834
- Come on.
- Hey, I-I gotta say,

02:06:22.835 --> 02:06:24.126
I'm a real big fan
of everything you've done.

02:06:24.668 --> 02:06:26.500
I'm more than a
little awe-inspired right now.

02:06:26.501 --> 02:06:27.835
- The way that you--
- Shut up.

02:06:29.335 --> 02:06:30.335
What's the plan?

02:06:31.168 --> 02:06:32.960
This is as far as I'd got.

02:06:33.960 --> 02:06:35.542
Well, then
there's no plan.

02:06:35.543 --> 02:06:36.750
Just Neytiri.

02:06:36.751 --> 02:06:37.751
Come on.

02:06:42.876 --> 02:06:43.835
Go, go, go.

02:06:46.668 --> 02:06:47.876
Go, go.

02:06:56.918 --> 02:06:58.001
Why are you
doing this?

02:06:59.168 --> 02:07:01.210
There's gonna be
a massive tulkun hunt

02:07:01.835 --> 02:07:03.460
the day after tomorrow.

02:07:04.126 --> 02:07:06.834
They're gonna hit them
with every ship they've got.

02:07:06.835 --> 02:07:08.043
The Calf Communion.

02:07:10.501 --> 02:07:12.084
You've got to stop them.

02:07:12.085 --> 02:07:13.585
You're the only one who can.

02:07:14.876 --> 02:07:15.960
Come on.

02:07:25.793 --> 02:07:26.751
Sa'ata...

02:07:30.710 --> 02:07:31.792
Let's go.

02:07:37.960 --> 02:07:39.918
- Oh, God.
- Tuck in.

02:07:40.418 --> 02:07:41.501
Go now. Go.

02:07:43.293 --> 02:07:45.376
Oh, shit.

02:07:49.793 --> 02:07:50.668
Damn it.

02:07:51.460 --> 02:07:52.918
Go! Get out of here!

02:07:54.835 --> 02:07:55.835
Oh, shit.

02:08:00.835 --> 02:08:02.042
Lima 1-6, there's a subject

02:08:02.043 --> 02:08:03.459
pinned down
behind a vehicle.

02:08:03.460 --> 02:08:04.876
- Is that Sully?
- He's pinned down.

02:08:05.501 --> 02:08:06.667
Switch missiles.
Take him out.

02:08:06.668 --> 02:08:08.293
Copy.
Switching missiles.

02:08:10.085 --> 02:08:11.126
Hey, remember me?

02:08:13.543 --> 02:08:16.000
That's right, pendejos.
Yeah.

02:08:16.001 --> 02:08:17.085
I don't need this shit.

02:08:18.418 --> 02:08:20.793
What are you gonna do?
You gonna shoot me?

02:08:22.960 --> 02:08:24.334
The kid's with him.
The air breather.

02:08:24.335 --> 02:08:26.126
- He's blocking my shot.
- Move, move.

02:08:26.918 --> 02:08:28.585
Don't shoot.
Tell him not to shoot.

02:08:29.918 --> 02:08:31.292
Lima 1-6, Blue One.

02:08:31.293 --> 02:08:33.543
Hold your fire.
Keep visual on him.

02:08:34.460 --> 02:08:35.375
1-6, hold your fire.

02:08:35.376 --> 02:08:36.875
Get more assets
on that position.

02:08:36.876 --> 02:08:38.500
Yeah, you're not gonna
shoot me. You know why?

02:08:38.501 --> 02:08:40.792
Because you can't.

02:08:40.793 --> 02:08:42.459
You know what
you can do though?

02:08:42.460 --> 02:08:43.750
You can kiss my ass.

02:08:43.751 --> 02:08:45.500
Yeah. Come on, Jake.

02:08:45.501 --> 02:08:46.792
Go. What are you doing?

02:08:46.793 --> 02:08:48.751
Come on. Go. Go.
Come on.

02:08:50.710 --> 02:08:51.834
He's moving west.

02:08:51.835 --> 02:08:54.000
Maintaining a target lock.
The shot is not clear.

02:08:55.335 --> 02:08:56.709
Hey, stay on me.

02:09:02.835 --> 02:09:03.876
Stay close
to me.

02:09:04.543 --> 02:09:05.834
I'm not gonna
play this game.

02:09:05.835 --> 02:09:07.376
Lima 1-6,
take your shot.

02:09:08.126 --> 02:09:09.459
- No, don't shoot.
- Get him out of here.

02:09:09.460 --> 02:09:11.667
Belay that. Hold your fire.

02:09:11.668 --> 02:09:13.167
Go, go, go.

02:09:13.168 --> 02:09:14.084
Lima 1-6--

02:09:14.085 --> 02:09:15.334
- What are you doing, man?
- Lima 1-6,

02:09:15.335 --> 02:09:16.542
you are cleared hot.
Weapons free.

02:09:16.543 --> 02:09:18.501
Unable. I've lost visual.
Coming around.

02:09:20.751 --> 02:09:22.584
- He's coming back around.
- This way.

02:09:22.585 --> 02:09:23.667
This is

02:09:23.668 --> 02:09:24.792
Blue One.
Check your fire.

02:09:24.793 --> 02:09:26.000
Lima 1-6,

02:09:26.001 --> 02:09:27.709
you are cleared hot.

02:09:27.710 --> 02:09:28.751
1-6, in hot.

02:09:35.710 --> 02:09:36.710
Down!

02:09:45.835 --> 02:09:47.085
Ma Jake.

02:09:47.835 --> 02:09:48.793
Neytiri.

02:09:50.210 --> 02:09:51.417
Baby.

02:09:51.418 --> 02:09:53.626
I don't know whether
to kiss you or yell at you.

02:09:54.126 --> 02:09:55.125
You waste time.

02:09:56.210 --> 02:09:57.376
Come on. Let's go.

02:09:59.918 --> 02:10:02.085
Let's go.

02:10:16.043 --> 02:10:17.918
Land anywhere.

02:10:40.501 --> 02:10:42.626
Man, I gotta take
a huge leak.

02:10:43.668 --> 02:10:45.251
You guys landed
just in time.

02:10:46.710 --> 02:10:47.710
What is it?

02:10:48.376 --> 02:10:49.585
Why are we stopping?

02:10:55.085 --> 02:10:57.417
They didn't even
put a fly in this thing.

02:10:57.418 --> 02:10:58.293
That's just dumb.

02:10:59.460 --> 02:11:00.542
Good idea.

02:11:00.543 --> 02:11:02.417
Drink first,
then piss in the stream.

02:11:02.418 --> 02:11:03.668
What is it, Jake?

02:11:05.168 --> 02:11:06.501
I was wrong.

02:11:07.293 --> 02:11:09.168
We can't protect him.

02:11:10.501 --> 02:11:12.835
I've gotta take this stuff off.
It's itchy as hell.

02:11:14.043 --> 02:11:15.209
Quaritch has this woman.

02:11:15.210 --> 02:11:17.085
He can find us
wherever we go.

02:11:19.418 --> 02:11:21.125
They will get him.

02:11:21.126 --> 02:11:23.209
They will study him.

02:11:23.210 --> 02:11:25.543
And when humans
can breathe our air...

02:11:27.585 --> 02:11:30.375
then they will spread
across this world,

02:11:30.376 --> 02:11:32.209
and they will destroy
the forests,

02:11:32.210 --> 02:11:33.292
the oceans, everything.

02:11:33.293 --> 02:11:35.043
Just like on Earth.

02:11:35.751 --> 02:11:37.625
Then the Na'vi people

02:11:37.626 --> 02:11:38.668
will be gone.

02:11:39.585 --> 02:11:41.626
The tulkun will be gone.

02:11:42.418 --> 02:11:45.459
And I can't let that happen.

02:11:45.460 --> 02:11:46.542
Man. Are you hungry?

02:11:46.543 --> 02:11:48.001
'Cause I'm starving.

02:11:54.335 --> 02:11:55.418
You were right.

02:12:00.793 --> 02:12:02.085
It has to be done.

02:12:04.168 --> 02:12:05.168
Jake.

02:12:07.543 --> 02:12:09.168
He saved your life.

02:12:20.376 --> 02:12:22.126
This is the only way.

02:12:34.751 --> 02:12:36.001
Spider...

02:12:37.835 --> 02:12:38.835
Come here.

02:12:46.043 --> 02:12:47.043
What's
going on?

02:12:50.335 --> 02:12:51.376
What is it?

02:12:52.251 --> 02:12:53.543
Just come with me.

02:12:56.043 --> 02:12:57.126
Come on. Let's go.

02:13:06.918 --> 02:13:08.709
Hey, stop for a second.
I gotta take a leak.

02:13:08.710 --> 02:13:10.126
Just stay close.

02:13:19.293 --> 02:13:20.418
Where are we going?

02:13:21.085 --> 02:13:22.168
Be quiet.

02:13:37.585 --> 02:13:39.543
So, is this,
like, a talk?

02:13:52.418 --> 02:13:53.417
Come here.

02:13:53.418 --> 02:13:54.751
Come on.
Come on.

02:13:55.918 --> 02:13:56.835
Go.

02:13:58.626 --> 02:13:59.793
This'll work.

02:14:01.043 --> 02:14:02.043
Kneel.

02:14:02.751 --> 02:14:04.042
Kneel.

02:14:04.043 --> 02:14:05.125
- No.
- Kneel down.

02:14:06.751 --> 02:14:08.542
Please.

02:14:08.543 --> 02:14:10.043
Jake, please stop.

02:14:10.668 --> 02:14:12.835
Eyes front. Don't move.

02:14:13.418 --> 02:14:14.792
Please,

02:14:14.793 --> 02:14:16.167
you don't have
to do this.

02:14:16.168 --> 02:14:18.209
Shh!

02:14:18.210 --> 02:14:19.210
Please.

02:14:20.210 --> 02:14:21.835
Great Mother, are you here?

02:14:23.835 --> 02:14:25.210
You don't
have to do this.

02:14:26.085 --> 02:14:27.125
Guide my hand.

02:14:27.126 --> 02:14:28.209
Please don't do this.

02:14:28.210 --> 02:14:29.584
Give me strength.

02:14:29.585 --> 02:14:31.084
Just stop.

02:14:31.085 --> 02:14:32.918
Please stop. Please.

02:14:33.460 --> 02:14:34.917
- Don't look at me.
- Please.

02:14:34.918 --> 02:14:36.043
Don't look at me.

02:14:38.960 --> 02:14:40.085
Forgive me, Son.

02:14:40.585 --> 02:14:41.667
I'll be good.

02:14:41.668 --> 02:14:43.334
May your spirit go to Eywa.

02:14:43.335 --> 02:14:44.667
- I promise.
- May your body

02:14:44.668 --> 02:14:46.334
return to the forest...

02:14:47.585 --> 02:14:48.667
Please, Dad.

02:14:48.668 --> 02:14:50.293
...to preserve
the Great Balance.

02:14:51.126 --> 02:14:53.292
May the ancestors
welcome you.

02:15:08.043 --> 02:15:09.043
Please.

02:15:10.043 --> 02:15:12.459
May the ancestors
hold you.

02:15:12.460 --> 02:15:14.376
May they sing
your Song.

02:15:15.751 --> 02:15:17.585
I know I have to go
to Eywa now.

02:15:19.001 --> 02:15:20.251
It's okay.

02:15:21.210 --> 02:15:22.210
But...

02:15:23.585 --> 02:15:24.585
Do you...

02:15:25.668 --> 02:15:27.085
Do you still love me?

02:15:29.085 --> 02:15:30.626
With all my heart.

02:16:14.626 --> 02:16:16.210
Ma Jake. Ma Jake.

02:16:27.793 --> 02:16:29.251
I See you.

02:16:36.585 --> 02:16:39.417
Whatever happens,
it won't be this way.

02:16:41.501 --> 02:16:43.751
Then we will find
another way.

02:17:00.460 --> 02:17:01.668
My dad knew
in his heart

02:17:02.168 --> 02:17:03.125
there was only

02:17:03.126 --> 02:17:05.335
ever one path.

02:17:12.418 --> 02:17:14.293
No matter
how you imagine yourself,

02:17:15.210 --> 02:17:16.335
as a father,

02:17:16.876 --> 02:17:18.001
as a husband,

02:17:18.835 --> 02:17:20.001
sooner or later,

02:17:20.668 --> 02:17:21.793
you're back on it.

02:17:41.418 --> 02:17:43.084
Hello, old friend.

02:17:45.626 --> 02:17:47.376
Toruk loved my father.

02:17:50.126 --> 02:17:52.210
It knew they were
greater together.

02:17:52.793 --> 02:17:53.793
That when they flew,

02:17:54.918 --> 02:17:56.210
there would be blood.

02:17:59.793 --> 02:18:00.918
He is coming.

02:18:25.585 --> 02:18:27.167
Toruk Makto!

02:18:30.418 --> 02:18:32.042
No, no, no. Just...

02:18:32.043 --> 02:18:33.917
Please, stand.

02:18:33.918 --> 02:18:35.960
Stand up. Please.

02:18:36.626 --> 02:18:37.835
- Baby.
- Jake.

02:18:39.043 --> 02:18:40.709
Please. It's okay.

02:18:40.710 --> 02:18:41.710
It's okay.

02:18:43.793 --> 02:18:45.459
Go now

02:18:45.460 --> 02:18:47.000
to all the clans
within a day's ride

02:18:47.001 --> 02:18:48.043
and tell 'em...

02:18:51.043 --> 02:18:53.085
Tell 'em Toruk Makto
calls to them.

02:18:55.126 --> 02:18:56.710
And you tell 'em...

02:18:58.376 --> 02:18:59.835
the day has come.

02:19:39.793 --> 02:19:41.376
And so it came to pass

02:19:42.085 --> 02:19:43.959
that Toruk Makto
returned.

02:19:43.960 --> 02:19:45.959
My father united
the clans

02:19:45.960 --> 02:19:47.126
once again.

02:19:48.293 --> 02:19:49.918
He made the
great speeches.

02:19:50.460 --> 02:19:51.667
Many arrows together

02:19:51.668 --> 02:19:53.710
cannot be broken.

02:19:56.001 --> 02:19:58.167
We cannot be broken!

02:20:05.876 --> 02:20:08.210
But he knew
that it wasn't enough.

02:20:26.293 --> 02:20:28.125
Great Matriarch,

02:20:28.126 --> 02:20:29.460
wise elders,

02:20:31.293 --> 02:20:32.710
the Sky People are coming.

02:20:33.668 --> 02:20:34.959
Here, today.

02:20:34.960 --> 02:20:36.126
Right now.

02:20:37.126 --> 02:20:38.793
To kill our tulkun families.

02:20:39.585 --> 02:20:40.585
I beg you,

02:20:41.710 --> 02:20:42.918
fight with us.

02:20:51.376 --> 02:20:54.126
She says,
"We respect Toruk Makto,

02:20:55.085 --> 02:20:56.835
but our ways
are ancient."

02:21:01.085 --> 02:21:02.667
"We believe

02:21:02.668 --> 02:21:04.918
that killing will only
bring more killing,

02:21:05.585 --> 02:21:08.251
in an endless,
expanding spiral."

02:21:11.001 --> 02:21:12.210
Hear my words.

02:21:13.835 --> 02:21:16.501
The Sky People
will never stop.

02:21:17.168 --> 02:21:19.585
Not until the last
of the tulkun is hunted.

02:21:27.043 --> 02:21:27.918
Lo'ak.

02:21:41.835 --> 02:21:43.000
Stop.

02:21:43.001 --> 02:21:44.584
Lo'ak, what are you doing?
You can't be here.

02:21:44.585 --> 02:21:45.835
Dad, wait.

02:21:47.418 --> 02:21:50.084
I am Brother of tulkun.
I have a right to speak.

02:21:50.085 --> 02:21:53.168
Lo'ak speaks the truth.
You must listen.

02:21:53.710 --> 02:21:54.710
Tsireya.

02:21:59.335 --> 02:22:01.918
She says,
"His Brother is outcast."

02:22:02.668 --> 02:22:05.043
You have no standing here.

02:22:07.043 --> 02:22:08.543
If he is outcast,

02:22:09.376 --> 02:22:11.001
then I am outcast.

02:22:12.001 --> 02:22:14.167
And I am outcast.

02:22:14.168 --> 02:22:15.667
Daughter, silence.

02:22:15.668 --> 02:22:16.668
No.

02:22:17.168 --> 02:22:19.001
You will never
see me again.

02:22:21.126 --> 02:22:23.584
And I and my Brother
are outcast.

02:22:23.585 --> 02:22:25.000
Aonung.

02:22:25.001 --> 02:22:27.250
And we are

02:22:27.251 --> 02:22:28.168
also outcast.

02:22:40.668 --> 02:22:43.210
She says,
"You may speak."

02:22:47.501 --> 02:22:49.000
Hear my words.

02:22:49.001 --> 02:22:51.167
My Brother returned
to his birth clan

02:22:51.168 --> 02:22:52.293
to defend them,

02:22:53.001 --> 02:22:55.125
but his clan
was wiped out

02:22:55.126 --> 02:22:56.460
by the demon ships.

02:22:56.960 --> 02:22:58.626
Only Ta'nok survived,

02:22:59.168 --> 02:23:00.710
because she fought back.

02:23:02.126 --> 02:23:03.251
Come forward.

02:23:30.501 --> 02:23:31.792
Ta'nok says,

02:23:31.793 --> 02:23:35.126
"I speak
for the dead mothers

02:23:35.960 --> 02:23:36.960
and the dead calves."

02:23:42.876 --> 02:23:45.626
"I speak for my people
and all our Songs."

02:23:48.210 --> 02:23:49.251
"Gone.

02:23:50.835 --> 02:23:52.001
Forever."

02:23:56.960 --> 02:23:57.875
She says,

02:23:57.876 --> 02:24:00.876
"I am the last.
The blind witness to our end."

02:24:07.543 --> 02:24:08.625
Ta'nok says,

02:24:08.626 --> 02:24:10.751
"The tulkun way
must change.

02:24:11.293 --> 02:24:13.126
Payakan shows our path."

02:24:20.918 --> 02:24:22.585
"We must fight."

02:24:23.085 --> 02:24:24.418
We must fight!

02:24:42.001 --> 02:24:43.335
What did she say?

02:24:44.001 --> 02:24:45.460
They will decide.

02:24:46.876 --> 02:24:47.793
Look at all of this.

02:24:49.043 --> 02:24:51.085
I mean, there's
hundreds of 'em.

02:24:52.126 --> 02:24:53.792
And look at all
these old ones.

02:24:53.793 --> 02:24:54.960
And old is good.

02:24:55.876 --> 02:24:57.293
They never stop growing,

02:24:58.126 --> 02:24:59.585
which means more amrita.

02:25:01.043 --> 02:25:02.459
And look at this mama.

02:25:02.460 --> 02:25:03.375
She must be

02:25:03.376 --> 02:25:04.543
100 meters.

02:25:06.001 --> 02:25:07.001
You're briefing
without me.

02:25:08.376 --> 02:25:10.043
An oversight,
I assume.

02:25:10.543 --> 02:25:12.335
No, it was not
an oversight.

02:25:12.918 --> 02:25:14.209
After your fiasco
with Sully,

02:25:14.210 --> 02:25:15.376
you're done, Colonel.

02:25:16.043 --> 02:25:17.167
You're confined to base

02:25:17.168 --> 02:25:18.293
pending
an investigation.

02:25:19.126 --> 02:25:21.084
Negative on that. I need to roll.

02:25:21.085 --> 02:25:23.250
Sully will be there,
which means that Spider

02:25:23.251 --> 02:25:24.250
will be there as well.

02:25:24.251 --> 02:25:25.167
Don't look at him.

02:25:25.168 --> 02:25:26.501
He's one step away
from the brig himself.

02:25:27.126 --> 02:25:28.584
Don't tell him
not to look at me.

02:25:28.585 --> 02:25:30.709
What are you gonna do?
Call Daddy?

02:25:30.710 --> 02:25:32.543
- You mean the chairman?
- That's enough.

02:25:34.335 --> 02:25:36.834
I can still complete
this mission.

02:25:36.835 --> 02:25:37.918
Look at you.

02:25:38.585 --> 02:25:40.250
You're a disgrace
to your uniform.

02:25:40.251 --> 02:25:42.751
Assuming you remember
what a uniform is.

02:25:44.085 --> 02:25:46.084
You're grounded, Colonel.

02:25:46.085 --> 02:25:47.293
Permanently.

02:26:02.835 --> 02:26:04.793
Why are you here, girl?

02:26:07.293 --> 02:26:08.710
To pray, Tsahìk.

02:26:13.501 --> 02:26:14.626
No, child.

02:26:18.543 --> 02:26:20.418
Why did you
come to us?

02:26:23.585 --> 02:26:24.751
Perhaps

02:26:25.251 --> 02:26:26.959
it was for this moment.

02:26:29.001 --> 02:26:30.084
Only a chosen one

02:26:30.085 --> 02:26:31.251
may call

02:26:32.001 --> 02:26:33.709
upon the Warrior Mother.

02:26:38.001 --> 02:26:39.376
Tsahìk.

02:26:40.168 --> 02:26:41.668
You're having contractions.

02:26:42.210 --> 02:26:44.000
I fear we will...

02:26:44.001 --> 02:26:45.834
we will not survive this.

02:26:50.668 --> 02:26:51.668
Kiri.

02:26:54.668 --> 02:26:56.251
Hear my words.

02:26:57.126 --> 02:27:00.126
If there is something
you can do,

02:27:01.876 --> 02:27:03.918
then you must
do it.

02:27:06.835 --> 02:27:09.710
You have
a strong heart.

02:27:10.793 --> 02:27:11.793
Here.

02:27:12.751 --> 02:27:13.835
I'm riding with you?

02:27:14.501 --> 02:27:15.960
No, I need you here.

02:27:17.876 --> 02:27:18.959
I can't do this

02:27:18.960 --> 02:27:21.459
unless I know
you kids are safe.

02:27:21.460 --> 02:27:23.209
You keep your post
no matter what happens.

02:27:23.210 --> 02:27:24.210
You read me?

02:27:25.001 --> 02:27:26.210
Lima Charlie, sir.

02:27:33.001 --> 02:27:34.626
If your father and I
do not return,

02:27:35.335 --> 02:27:37.625
you take Spider
and the girls

02:27:37.626 --> 02:27:40.543
and you go as far
and as fast as you can.

02:28:27.835 --> 02:28:29.251
Holy shit.

02:28:33.918 --> 02:28:36.168
General, this flux
is off the scale.

02:28:36.751 --> 02:28:39.042
Keep a wide radius
from that flux devil.

02:28:39.043 --> 02:28:41.042
That thing
will rip your face off.

02:28:41.043 --> 02:28:43.251
Roger.
Gun runner coming right.

02:28:59.918 --> 02:29:01.000
Okay, boys.

02:29:01.001 --> 02:29:02.667
Let's make
some bank.

02:29:02.668 --> 02:29:04.417
Yeah.

02:29:04.418 --> 02:29:06.460
Let's go.
Let's do this.

02:29:10.001 --> 02:29:11.668
Whoo!

02:29:17.126 --> 02:29:19.210
Sub teams,
get wet.

02:29:29.293 --> 02:29:30.500
Yeah, baby.

02:29:30.501 --> 02:29:31.668
Let's do this.

02:29:41.418 --> 02:29:42.959
See any hostiles?

02:29:42.960 --> 02:29:44.625
Negative. No movement.

02:29:44.626 --> 02:29:45.709
And the big guys

02:29:45.710 --> 02:29:47.043
are just doing
their thing.

02:29:49.626 --> 02:29:51.460
Fish in a barrel, Scoresby.

02:29:52.210 --> 02:29:53.210
Hold.

02:29:56.793 --> 02:29:58.001
Just hold.

02:29:58.751 --> 02:30:00.293
Hold.

02:30:01.335 --> 02:30:02.335
Hold.

02:30:12.543 --> 02:30:13.501
Hang on.

02:30:14.585 --> 02:30:16.085
There's no bulls

02:30:16.710 --> 02:30:18.251
and no big females.

02:30:19.168 --> 02:30:20.460
There's no elders.

02:30:22.918 --> 02:30:24.376
Hold up, everybody.

02:30:25.126 --> 02:30:27.085
Sir, I got a big signature.

02:30:27.585 --> 02:30:29.501
Tulkun. Big ones.

02:30:30.251 --> 02:30:31.459
Lots of big ones.

02:30:31.460 --> 02:30:32.793
Multiple tulkun inbound.

02:30:45.418 --> 02:30:47.125
Scoresby,
I thought you told me

02:30:47.126 --> 02:30:48.210
they're not aggressive.

02:30:48.710 --> 02:30:50.043
Well, they're not.

02:30:51.085 --> 02:30:52.168
Generally.

02:31:02.668 --> 02:31:04.210
I've lost visual.

02:31:33.835 --> 02:31:35.375
Dude, they're fighting.

02:31:35.376 --> 02:31:37.084
Yes! Yes!

02:31:52.460 --> 02:31:54.126
This way. Get to the hatch!

02:32:01.085 --> 02:32:02.167
Now!

02:32:32.001 --> 02:32:33.043
Watch out!

02:32:55.126 --> 02:32:56.667
Man your weapons.

02:32:56.668 --> 02:32:57.918
Open fire.

02:33:23.251 --> 02:33:24.085
Port side.

02:33:29.585 --> 02:33:30.418
Reload.

02:33:31.085 --> 02:33:31.918
Watch out!

02:34:05.126 --> 02:34:06.459
Yeah, Jake.

02:34:06.460 --> 02:34:07.626
Bro, look.

02:34:19.668 --> 02:34:20.750
Yes!

02:34:20.751 --> 02:34:21.667
Yeah!

02:34:33.710 --> 02:34:36.876
Jake.

02:34:41.293 --> 02:34:42.501
It's the Ash.

02:34:43.460 --> 02:34:45.334
Bogeys inbound.
Banshee riders.

02:34:45.335 --> 02:34:46.667
Over a hundred.

02:34:46.668 --> 02:34:48.875
They're friendlies.
They have IFF badges.

02:34:48.876 --> 02:34:49.959
They're ours.

02:34:49.960 --> 02:34:52.500
Thanks for getting Sully
out in the open, General.

02:34:52.501 --> 02:34:53.960
I'll take it from here.

02:35:30.626 --> 02:35:31.876
They can't win.

02:35:33.126 --> 02:35:34.418
They're dying.

02:35:36.501 --> 02:35:38.793
Kiri!

02:35:39.335 --> 02:35:41.376
- Stop her!
- Kiri. Kiri, stop.

02:35:42.126 --> 02:35:43.667
- Kiri.
- Stop, stop, stop. Get back

02:35:43.668 --> 02:35:45.334
to the shelter right now.
It's not safe out here.

02:35:45.335 --> 02:35:47.334
I have to call
to the Great Mother.

02:35:47.335 --> 02:35:49.167
If you connect underwater,
it'll kill you.

02:35:49.168 --> 02:35:50.667
You can't do this.
We have to go.

02:35:50.668 --> 02:35:52.084
No, Tuk. You can't be
out here right now.

02:35:52.085 --> 02:35:53.085
Go. Get back.

02:35:53.793 --> 02:35:55.335
- Kiri, wait. No, stop.
- Kiri, stop.

02:35:56.793 --> 02:35:58.501
- Kiri, stop.
- Kiri!

02:35:59.043 --> 02:36:00.751
- Kiri.
- Kiri.

02:36:01.626 --> 02:36:03.126
- Come on.
- No, wait.

02:36:04.335 --> 02:36:07.668
Crap, crap... Tuk, you stay back.
I mean it.

02:36:08.376 --> 02:36:09.543
Lo'ak, come on.

02:36:10.210 --> 02:36:11.542
Do not
follow me.

02:36:11.543 --> 02:36:12.501
Come on.

02:36:41.960 --> 02:36:43.250
Lo'ak,
they're coming.

02:36:43.251 --> 02:36:44.251
Fight with us.

02:36:47.668 --> 02:36:49.292
Go. I'll stay with her.

02:36:49.293 --> 02:36:50.334
Come on.

02:37:04.418 --> 02:37:06.042
All Mother,

02:37:06.043 --> 02:37:07.418
hear my
words.

02:37:08.460 --> 02:37:09.460
Please help
us.

02:37:11.376 --> 02:37:12.335
I beg you.

02:37:13.418 --> 02:37:15.168
You are our only hope.

02:37:28.751 --> 02:37:29.792
Please.

02:37:29.793 --> 02:37:30.876
We need you.

02:37:33.043 --> 02:37:35.125
Don't push me away.

02:37:39.251 --> 02:37:40.293
Please don't.

02:37:41.126 --> 02:37:43.543
No. Please, please.

02:37:50.918 --> 02:37:53.501
No, no, no.

02:37:55.335 --> 02:37:56.459
Monkey Boy.

02:37:56.460 --> 02:37:57.460
Let's do this.

02:37:58.418 --> 02:37:59.418
Come on.

02:38:01.835 --> 02:38:02.835
Come on.

02:38:04.085 --> 02:38:04.960
Fire.

02:38:20.918 --> 02:38:23.251
I beg you. Please.

02:38:27.126 --> 02:38:28.542
No, please.

02:38:28.543 --> 02:38:30.710
The People are dying.

02:38:38.876 --> 02:38:41.001
Please, no.

02:38:42.960 --> 02:38:44.335
- Tuk.
- Come on.

02:38:45.251 --> 02:38:46.251
Come on.

02:38:46.960 --> 02:38:47.960
We can do this.

02:38:51.085 --> 02:38:52.418
Sullys never quit.

02:39:10.585 --> 02:39:11.585
Come on.
Let's go.

02:39:12.335 --> 02:39:13.918
- Tuk.
- Come on.

02:39:32.835 --> 02:39:35.084
Great Mother, help us.

02:39:35.085 --> 02:39:36.085
We beg you.

02:39:37.293 --> 02:39:39.210
The People are dying.

02:39:41.335 --> 02:39:43.334
I call upon
the Warrior Mother.

02:39:43.335 --> 02:39:45.335
You are our only hope.

02:40:45.668 --> 02:40:46.585
Fire.

02:40:57.126 --> 02:40:58.834
No!

02:41:02.085 --> 02:41:03.501
That's him.
Get after him.

02:41:09.210 --> 02:41:10.751
Flank out.
Box him in.

02:41:41.001 --> 02:41:42.001
Sa'ata.

02:41:42.626 --> 02:41:43.626
Good girl.

02:41:44.418 --> 02:41:45.418
Good girl.

02:42:01.376 --> 02:42:02.835
- You okay?
- Yes.

02:42:04.460 --> 02:42:05.834
Where's Kiri?

02:42:10.376 --> 02:42:12.585
Jake, I'm down.

02:42:14.001 --> 02:42:15.001
Get to safety.

02:42:15.543 --> 02:42:16.835
Do not attack.

02:42:19.418 --> 02:42:20.500
We're done.

02:42:23.918 --> 02:42:24.918
No.

02:42:39.751 --> 02:42:40.585
Dad!

02:42:41.710 --> 02:42:42.876
- Lo'ak.
- Dad.

02:42:44.043 --> 02:42:45.042
- Lo'ak.
- It's okay.

02:42:45.043 --> 02:42:46.126
I got you.

02:42:53.543 --> 02:42:54.625
Tsahìk.

02:43:07.626 --> 02:43:09.250
You stay here.
I'm going back for her.

02:43:09.251 --> 02:43:11.335
You can't leave me by myself.

02:43:21.043 --> 02:43:22.167
Sa'ata, wait.

02:43:27.293 --> 02:43:28.293
I am dying.

02:43:28.835 --> 02:43:30.375
No, you're not.

02:43:30.376 --> 02:43:32.960
Why must you always argue?

02:43:33.793 --> 02:43:34.875
I am...

02:43:34.876 --> 02:43:36.500
I am dying.

02:43:36.501 --> 02:43:38.751
But first I will
push out this baby.

02:43:48.085 --> 02:43:49.376
Then push!

02:43:51.543 --> 02:43:52.751
I got you.

02:43:58.751 --> 02:44:00.084
I'm gonna pull it
on three.

02:44:00.085 --> 02:44:01.542
Don't. Don't.
Just...

02:44:01.543 --> 02:44:02.709
Just don't.

02:44:02.710 --> 02:44:04.043
I gotta pack
the wound.

02:44:17.918 --> 02:44:19.751
Kiri. Kiri.

02:44:20.543 --> 02:44:21.459
Kiri.

02:44:30.001 --> 02:44:31.001
Are you
okay?

02:44:32.751 --> 02:44:34.043
- I'm okay.
- Good.

02:44:35.835 --> 02:44:37.501
Push, Tsahìk.

02:44:42.085 --> 02:44:43.959
You have one more push.

02:44:45.501 --> 02:44:46.501
She is coming.

02:44:47.460 --> 02:44:48.460
She is coming.

02:44:52.418 --> 02:44:54.001
Take your child.

02:45:00.085 --> 02:45:01.168
Thank you...

02:45:02.793 --> 02:45:03.793
Neytiri.

02:45:04.501 --> 02:45:05.584
Thank you.

02:45:09.960 --> 02:45:11.001
What is her name...

02:45:13.126 --> 02:45:14.125
She is...

02:45:14.126 --> 02:45:15.667
She is Pril.

02:45:18.460 --> 02:45:19.501
Be strong.

02:45:24.960 --> 02:45:26.792
Pril is a
good name.

02:45:28.168 --> 02:45:29.959
You will protect her?

02:45:31.876 --> 02:45:32.876
Yes.

02:45:56.168 --> 02:45:58.501
Dad, I'm...
I'm sorry I left my post.

02:45:59.126 --> 02:46:01.167
- It's okay, Son.
- No.

02:46:01.168 --> 02:46:03.042
You've proven yourself to me.

02:46:04.460 --> 02:46:07.126
I mean,
getting the tulkun to fight.

02:46:08.626 --> 02:46:10.418
Toruk Makto couldn't do it,

02:46:11.001 --> 02:46:12.001
and you did it.

02:46:13.543 --> 02:46:14.835
I'm proud of you.

02:46:43.626 --> 02:46:44.875
Twenty-two,
what's your status?

02:46:44.876 --> 02:46:45.876
Casualties?

02:46:47.001 --> 02:46:48.210
All right, people.

02:46:49.168 --> 02:46:50.917
Let's get ourselves
together.

02:46:50.918 --> 02:46:52.917
We've still got
work to do.

02:46:52.918 --> 02:46:54.585
Seriously?

02:46:56.585 --> 02:46:58.125
There's a hundred
billion dollars

02:46:58.126 --> 02:46:59.209
waiting in that cove,

02:46:59.210 --> 02:47:01.251
and nothing
standing in our way.

02:47:03.210 --> 02:47:04.543
Beers are on me.

02:47:06.126 --> 02:47:07.209
Your name

02:47:07.210 --> 02:47:08.585
is Pril.

02:47:10.210 --> 02:47:11.792
Your mother
was powerful.

02:47:11.793 --> 02:47:13.042
You will be
powerful too.

02:47:13.043 --> 02:47:14.043
Mrs. Sully.

02:47:34.043 --> 02:47:34.960
Spoils of war.

02:47:36.460 --> 02:47:38.335
Dad.
Dad, look.

02:47:40.001 --> 02:47:41.001
No!

02:47:50.501 --> 02:47:51.668
I need you now.

02:47:53.335 --> 02:47:54.625
By my side.

02:47:54.626 --> 02:47:56.710
I need my wingman.

02:47:57.293 --> 02:47:59.376
- Okay.
- Let's move out.

02:48:12.376 --> 02:48:15.084
Jake, I know
you're out there.

02:48:15.085 --> 02:48:16.168
I know you can hear me.

02:48:17.335 --> 02:48:20.001
Varang here's lighting up
your wife pretty good.

02:48:26.043 --> 02:48:26.876
No!

02:48:29.043 --> 02:48:31.167
Now, I want you
to come in,

02:48:31.168 --> 02:48:33.000
and I want you
to bring Spider with you.

02:48:33.001 --> 02:48:35.335
And I know
you copy that.

02:48:36.460 --> 02:48:37.709
Thanks, baby.

02:48:43.376 --> 02:48:45.710
Picadors, get in there.
Go, go.

02:48:46.293 --> 02:48:47.293
Go!

02:49:01.085 --> 02:49:02.167
They're trapping them.

02:49:02.168 --> 02:49:04.210
Let's get those heifers
herded in tight.

02:49:20.960 --> 02:49:22.292
A hundred meters.

02:49:22.293 --> 02:49:24.168
Get me in there.
Get me in range.

02:49:26.793 --> 02:49:27.835
Shit.

02:49:30.418 --> 02:49:32.500
Matadors, ahead slow.

02:49:32.501 --> 02:49:33.710
Even spacing.

02:49:35.126 --> 02:49:36.209
Sub teams,

02:49:36.210 --> 02:49:38.125
torpedoes ready.

02:49:38.126 --> 02:49:39.542
Arm torpedoes.

02:49:39.543 --> 02:49:41.459
Arming one through four.
Torpedoes armed.

02:49:41.460 --> 02:49:42.543
Sixty meters.

02:49:43.210 --> 02:49:44.251
Target lock.

02:49:51.293 --> 02:49:52.460
Safeties off.

02:49:56.126 --> 02:49:57.460
Stand by to fire.

02:50:08.710 --> 02:50:10.085
Look.

02:50:24.710 --> 02:50:25.710
Hold your fire.

02:50:26.251 --> 02:50:27.542
Hold fire for what?

02:50:27.543 --> 02:50:29.335
We've got a situation
down here.

02:50:30.043 --> 02:50:31.293
It's Eywa. It worked.

02:50:32.335 --> 02:50:33.335
It worked.

02:50:54.543 --> 02:50:55.460
Look out!

02:50:56.376 --> 02:50:57.210
Get us out of here.

02:51:08.418 --> 02:51:09.500
Whoa.

02:51:09.501 --> 02:51:11.000
Look out!

02:51:18.793 --> 02:51:20.251
Go, go.
Hit it.

02:51:20.835 --> 02:51:23.084
All boats back to the ship.
All boats back

02:51:23.085 --> 02:51:24.085
to the ship.

02:51:26.293 --> 02:51:27.459
Yeah.

02:51:27.460 --> 02:51:29.085
That's right, buttholes.

02:52:06.001 --> 02:52:07.376
Oh, God.

02:52:26.668 --> 02:52:27.750
Get us out of here.

02:52:27.751 --> 02:52:29.501
Can't.
Propulsion's down.

02:53:28.335 --> 02:53:30.168
I need power.
Get me back up.

02:53:32.251 --> 02:53:33.542
General,

02:53:33.543 --> 02:53:34.960
flux devil's
pulling us in.

02:53:37.710 --> 02:53:38.710
Abandon ship.

02:53:40.085 --> 02:53:41.375
Abandon ship!

02:53:47.126 --> 02:53:48.168
Stay close.

02:53:59.293 --> 02:54:00.293
Stay close.

02:54:02.751 --> 02:54:03.751
Clear.

02:54:04.918 --> 02:54:05.918
Clear.

02:54:11.376 --> 02:54:12.834
Tuck in.

02:54:12.835 --> 02:54:14.126
Get to the lifeboats.
Get off the ship.

02:54:14.960 --> 02:54:15.875
Run!

02:54:20.335 --> 02:54:22.293
Okay. I'll need
covering fire.

02:54:23.543 --> 02:54:25.750
Okay.
I'm gonna push left,

02:54:25.751 --> 02:54:27.417
down the port side
and get around behind them.

02:54:27.418 --> 02:54:28.334
Get eyes on me.

02:54:28.335 --> 02:54:30.375
- Just watch me.
- Yes, sir.

02:54:30.376 --> 02:54:31.793
And don't shoot
anyone you love.

02:54:33.210 --> 02:54:34.210
Go, go.

02:54:46.793 --> 02:54:48.917
Colonel,
this is Spider.

02:54:48.918 --> 02:54:50.000
I'm here.

02:54:50.001 --> 02:54:51.168
Don't kill them.

02:54:54.210 --> 02:54:55.251
Where are you, boy?

02:54:55.751 --> 02:54:56.876
Step out now.

02:54:59.001 --> 02:55:00.668
All right.
I'll come out.

02:55:13.418 --> 02:55:14.542
Spider!

02:55:14.543 --> 02:55:15.834
Do you hear me?

02:55:15.835 --> 02:55:17.293
We're running out of time.

02:55:25.876 --> 02:55:26.710
Come on.

02:55:32.085 --> 02:55:33.126
Tsahìk.

02:55:42.460 --> 02:55:43.835
I'm here to make a deal.

02:55:44.835 --> 02:55:45.835
Me for them.

02:55:46.543 --> 02:55:47.751
That can happen.

02:55:48.876 --> 02:55:50.500
Come with me, Son.

02:55:50.501 --> 02:55:52.084
I'm a man of my word.

02:55:52.085 --> 02:55:54.625
We can resolve this
here and now.

02:55:54.626 --> 02:55:55.876
Everybody goes home.

02:56:05.626 --> 02:56:06.834
Circle up.

02:56:06.835 --> 02:56:07.917
We're out of here.

02:56:30.293 --> 02:56:31.209
Tuk.

02:56:37.751 --> 02:56:39.209
Come on, Tuk.

02:56:53.751 --> 02:56:56.500
Leave my mother alone.

02:57:02.960 --> 02:57:04.168
Bitch!

02:57:28.626 --> 02:57:30.126
Hyah.

02:57:30.960 --> 02:57:32.042
Go find your mother.

02:57:32.043 --> 02:57:33.168
Get her
off the ship.

02:57:50.876 --> 02:57:52.085
Hang on, kid.

02:58:09.710 --> 02:58:11.042
Spider, here.

02:58:11.043 --> 02:58:12.334
Jake!

02:58:12.335 --> 02:58:13.376
Spider.

02:58:24.960 --> 02:58:26.000
Jake.

02:58:26.001 --> 02:58:27.084
Spider.

02:58:39.168 --> 02:58:40.334
- Go.
- Grab on.

02:58:40.335 --> 02:58:41.292
Go, go!

02:59:07.418 --> 02:59:08.418
Shit.

02:59:16.918 --> 02:59:19.210
Jake! Jake!

02:59:38.043 --> 02:59:39.042
I'll kill you!

02:59:39.043 --> 02:59:40.335
I swear!

02:59:41.126 --> 02:59:43.168
You gonna kill
your own father?

02:59:44.293 --> 02:59:46.251
Do not test me.

02:59:48.876 --> 02:59:49.876
Give me that.

02:59:53.751 --> 02:59:55.585
You little bastard!

02:59:58.251 --> 02:59:59.625
Come on.
Jake, come on.

03:00:01.001 --> 03:00:02.042
Get out of here.

03:00:02.043 --> 03:00:03.001
Go on.

03:01:18.043 --> 03:01:19.043
Oh, shit.

03:01:39.418 --> 03:01:40.418
Jake!

03:01:41.293 --> 03:01:42.126
Jake!

03:01:48.085 --> 03:01:48.960
Son!

03:01:51.335 --> 03:01:52.210
Spider, no!

03:01:55.460 --> 03:01:56.542
Hand him up.

03:01:56.543 --> 03:01:57.543
Come on.

03:02:02.418 --> 03:02:03.751
Pull me up.

03:02:04.335 --> 03:02:07.250
Come on.

03:02:07.251 --> 03:02:08.835
If you hadn't've
shot me in the arm...

03:02:12.835 --> 03:02:14.043
I oughta let you go.

03:02:14.626 --> 03:02:15.793
Then do it,

03:02:16.626 --> 03:02:17.626
Dad.

03:02:18.543 --> 03:02:20.126
You're some
piece of work, kid.

03:02:21.585 --> 03:02:22.793
Pull us up.

03:02:46.668 --> 03:02:47.793
Take my hand.

03:02:55.085 --> 03:02:56.085
Jake.

03:02:56.585 --> 03:02:57.626
Come on.

03:02:59.001 --> 03:03:00.001
We got you.

03:03:00.543 --> 03:03:01.625
We got you.

03:03:17.751 --> 03:03:18.960
Well,
this is awkward.

03:03:26.335 --> 03:03:27.417
Now what?

03:03:27.418 --> 03:03:28.501
We all gonna

03:03:29.335 --> 03:03:31.251
hold hands and sing?

03:03:32.460 --> 03:03:33.918
I "learn to See"?

03:03:36.585 --> 03:03:38.126
You have a choice.

03:03:49.251 --> 03:03:52.668
Wait. Wait.

03:03:53.543 --> 03:03:54.668
Wait. Wait.

03:04:00.710 --> 03:04:02.334
Ain't this a bitch?

03:04:28.293 --> 03:04:29.293
Dad, Dad.

03:04:29.918 --> 03:04:31.709
Ma Jake, s-sit.

03:04:31.710 --> 03:04:32.709
Come here.

03:04:48.918 --> 03:04:50.668
The light always returns.

03:05:02.710 --> 03:05:03.792
We all connect

03:05:03.793 --> 03:05:05.126
with the Great Mother...

03:05:07.376 --> 03:05:08.875
who holds all her children

03:05:08.876 --> 03:05:09.876
in her heart.

03:05:15.043 --> 03:05:17.710
New life keeps
the energy flowing...

03:05:20.001 --> 03:05:21.376
like the breath
of the world.

03:05:25.001 --> 03:05:27.000
My Brother's voice was heard.

03:05:28.751 --> 03:05:30.668
He was accepted
by the clan.

03:05:44.876 --> 03:05:46.542
In the Spirit World,

03:05:46.543 --> 03:05:49.168
