of the ancestors.

03:05:51.918 --> 03:05:54.168
All those who have
walked the path before us.

03:06:06.418 --> 03:06:08.335
Come on, Monkey Boy. Come on.

03:06:17.585 --> 03:06:20.043
Go on. Go on.

03:06:29.001 --> 03:06:30.251
Sir.

03:06:31.751 --> 03:06:34.001
