03:06:34.501 --> 03:06:35.501
- Bro.
- Whoa.

03:06:37.085 --> 03:06:38.085
Skxawng.

03:06:39.751 --> 03:06:40.667
I'm happy to see you,

03:06:40.668 --> 03:06:41.626
Little Bro.

03:06:43.001 --> 03:06:44.084
Cuz.

03:06:44.085 --> 03:06:46.501
Mom,
this is Spider.

03:06:47.251 --> 03:06:48.626
I've heard
all about you.

03:06:50.126 --> 03:06:51.626
Troublemaker.

03:06:54.668 --> 03:06:55.959
You are alive

03:06:55.960 --> 03:06:57.293
